window.IELTS_TOPIC={"topic":16,"en":"Sport Science & Human Performance","zh":"運動科學與人體表現","items":[{"w":"muscle","pos":"n.","def":"body tissue that tightens and relaxes to make you move","cn":"肌肉","s":"Lifting heavy boxes every day made my uncle's arm ________ very strong, but he still hurt his back last month.","zh":"每天搬重箱子讓我叔叔的手臂肌肉非常強壯，但他上個月還是傷了背。","part":"A","sec":"The Human Body & Anatomy 人體與解剖","lab":"A1","t":"肌肉"},{"w":"muscular","pos":"adj.","def":"having big, strong muscles","cn":"肌肉發達的","s":"The swimmer has a very ________ back and shoulders, because she trains in the pool for four hours every morning.","zh":"這位泳者的背部和肩膀肌肉非常發達，因為她每天早上在泳池訓練四個小時。","part":"A","sec":"The Human Body & Anatomy 人體與解剖","lab":"A2","t":"肌肉非常發達"},{"w":"tendon","pos":"n.","def":"a strong band that joins a muscle to a bone","cn":"肌腱","s":"The runner felt sharp pain above his heel, so the doctor checked the ________ and told him to rest for two weeks.","zh":"那位跑者感到腳跟上方一陣刺痛，所以醫生檢查了他的肌腱，並叫他休息兩週。","part":"A","sec":"The Human Body & Anatomy 人體與解剖","lab":"A3","t":"肌腱"},{"w":"ligament","pos":"n.","def":"a strong band that holds bones together at a joint","cn":"韌帶","s":"She twisted her knee badly during the basketball game, and the scan showed that one ________ was partly damaged.","zh":"她在籃球比賽中嚴重扭傷膝蓋，而掃描顯示有一條韌帶部分受損。","part":"A","sec":"The Human Body & Anatomy 人體與解剖","lab":"A4","t":"韌帶"},{"w":"cartilage","pos":"n.","def":"smooth, soft tissue that protects the ends of bones","cn":"軟骨","s":"Years of running on hard roads wore down the ________ in his knees, so now he cycles instead of jogging.","zh":"多年在堅硬路面上跑步磨損了他膝蓋的軟骨，所以他現在改騎自行車而不慢跑了。","part":"A","sec":"The Human Body & Anatomy 人體與解剖","lab":"A5","t":"軟骨"},{"w":"bone density","pos":"n.phr.","def":"how strong and thick your bones are","cn":"骨質密度","s":"Jumping and weight training can improve your ______ ______, so teenagers who exercise often have stronger bones later in life.","zh":"跳躍和重量訓練能提升你的骨質密度，所以常運動的青少年日後通常擁有更強壯的骨骼。","part":"A","sec":"The Human Body & Anatomy 人體與解剖","lab":"A6","t":"骨質密度"},{"w":"hamstring","pos":"n.","def":"a muscle at the back of the upper leg","cn":"大腿後肌；膕繩肌","s":"The striker grabbed the back of his leg after a fast sprint, and the coach said he had probably pulled a ________.","zh":"那位前鋒在快速衝刺後抓住大腿後側，而教練說他可能拉傷了大腿後肌。","part":"A","sec":"The Human Body & Anatomy 人體與解剖","lab":"A7","t":"大腿後肌"},{"w":"quadriceps","pos":"n.","def":"the large muscle at the front of the upper leg","cn":"股四頭肌","s":"Squats build the ________ at the front of your thighs, and strong thighs help protect your knees when you land.","zh":"深蹲能鍛鍊大腿前側的股四頭肌，而強壯的大腿能在你落地時保護膝蓋。","part":"A","sec":"The Human Body & Anatomy 人體與解剖","lab":"A8","t":"股四頭肌"},{"w":"biceps","pos":"n.","def":"the muscle at the front of the upper arm","cn":"二頭肌","s":"My brother lifts dumbbells every night to make his ________ bigger, but his coach says he should train his legs too.","zh":"我哥哥每晚舉啞鈴想讓他的二頭肌變大，但他的教練說他也應該練腿。","part":"A","sec":"The Human Body & Anatomy 人體與解剖","lab":"A9","t":"二頭肌"},{"w":"abdominal","pos":"adj.","def":"relating to the stomach area","cn":"腹部的","s":"Planks strengthen your ________ muscles, and a strong middle helps you keep good posture when you sit at a desk.","zh":"棒式能強化你的腹部肌肉，而強壯的核心能幫助你坐在書桌前時保持良好姿勢。","part":"A","sec":"The Human Body & Anatomy 人體與解剖","lab":"A10","t":"腹部"},{"w":"pelvis","pos":"n.","def":"the large bone structure at the base of the spine","cn":"骨盆","s":"The dancer fell awkwardly during practice, and an X-ray showed a small crack in her ________, so she missed the show.","zh":"那位舞者在練習時摔得很不順，X光顯示她的骨盆有一道小裂痕，所以她錯過了演出。","part":"A","sec":"The Human Body & Anatomy 人體與解剖","lab":"A11","t":"骨盆"},{"w":"ankle","pos":"n.","def":"the joint between the foot and the leg","cn":"腳踝","s":"I landed on another player's foot and twisted my ________, so I had to watch the rest of the match from the bench.","zh":"我落地時踩到另一名球員的腳而扭傷了腳踝，所以我只能坐在板凳上看完剩下的比賽。","part":"A","sec":"The Human Body & Anatomy 人體與解剖","lab":"A12","t":"腳踝"},{"w":"kneecap","pos":"n.","def":"the small round bone at the front of the knee","cn":"膝蓋骨；髕骨","s":"The goalkeeper wore thick pads to protect his ________, because he often dives onto the hard ground during training.","zh":"那位守門員戴著厚護墊來保護他的膝蓋骨，因為他在訓練中常常撲倒在堅硬的地面上。","part":"A","sec":"The Human Body & Anatomy 人體與解剖","lab":"A13","t":"膝蓋骨"},{"w":"rib cage","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the bones that curve around your chest","cn":"胸腔；肋骨","s":"Boxers train their stomach muscles to protect their ______ ______, because a hard punch to the chest can break a bone.","zh":"拳擊手會訓練腹肌來保護胸腔，因為胸口挨一記重拳可能會打斷骨頭。","part":"A","sec":"The Human Body & Anatomy 人體與解剖","lab":"A14","t":"胸腔"},{"w":"lung","pos":"n.","def":"one of the two organs in your chest used for breathing","cn":"肺","s":"Swimmers usually have strong ________, because they must hold their breath underwater and breathe quickly between strokes.","zh":"游泳選手通常擁有強壯的肺，因為他們必須在水下憋氣，並在划水之間快速換氣。","part":"A","sec":"The Human Body & Anatomy 人體與解剖","lab":"A15","t":"肺"},{"w":"heart rate","pos":"n.phr.","def":"how many times your heart beats in one minute","cn":"心率；心跳速率","s":"My smartwatch shows my ______ ______ while I run, so I slow down when the number gets too high.","zh":"我的智慧手錶會在我跑步時顯示我的心率，所以當數字太高時我就放慢速度。","part":"A","sec":"The Human Body & Anatomy 人體與解剖","lab":"A16","t":"心率"},{"w":"artery","pos":"n.","def":"a tube that carries blood away from the heart","cn":"動脈","s":"Regular exercise keeps every ________ in your body flexible, while smoking and junk food can make them hard and narrow.","zh":"規律運動能讓你體內的每一條動脈保持彈性，而抽菸和垃圾食物會讓它們變硬變窄。","part":"A","sec":"The Human Body & Anatomy 人體與解剖","lab":"A17","t":"動脈"},{"w":"vein","pos":"n.","def":"a tube that carries blood back to the heart","cn":"靜脈","s":"After a hard workout the ________ in his arms stood out clearly, because more blood was flowing through his muscles.","zh":"激烈運動後他手臂上的靜脈清楚浮現，因為有更多血液流經他的肌肉。","part":"A","sec":"The Human Body & Anatomy 人體與解剖","lab":"A18","t":"靜脈"},{"w":"capillary","pos":"n.","def":"a very thin blood tube in the body","cn":"微血管","s":"Endurance training creates more ________ around the muscles, so oxygen can reach the working cells more easily.","zh":"耐力訓練會在肌肉周圍形成更多微血管，所以氧氣能更容易抵達運作中的細胞。","part":"A","sec":"The Human Body & Anatomy 人體與解剖","lab":"A19","t":"微血管"},{"w":"oxygen","pos":"n.","def":"the gas in the air that our bodies need","cn":"氧氣","s":"Climbers on Mount Everest often carry extra ________, because the air at the top is very thin and breathing becomes difficult.","zh":"攀登聖母峰的登山者常常攜帶額外的氧氣，因為山頂的空氣非常稀薄，呼吸會變得困難。","part":"A","sec":"The Human Body & Anatomy 人體與解剖","lab":"A20","t":"氧氣"},{"w":"haemoglobin","pos":"n.","def":"the substance in red blood cells that carries oxygen","cn":"血紅素","s":"Athletes who train in the mountains produce more ________, so their blood can carry extra oxygen when they race at sea level.","zh":"在山區訓練的運動員會產生更多血紅素，所以他們在海平面比賽時血液能攜帶更多氧氣。","part":"A","sec":"The Human Body & Anatomy 人體與解剖","lab":"A21","t":"血紅素"},{"w":"red blood cell","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a tiny cell in the blood that carries oxygen","cn":"紅血球","s":"Each ______ ______ ______ carries oxygen from the lungs to the muscles, and low iron can reduce how many your body makes.","zh":"每一個紅血球都會把氧氣從肺部運送到肌肉，而缺鐵會減少你身體製造紅血球的數量。","part":"A","sec":"The Human Body & Anatomy 人體與解剖","lab":"A22","t":"紅血球"},{"w":"lactic acid","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a substance made in muscles during very hard exercise","cn":"乳酸","s":"Her legs burned at the end of the 400-metre race, and her coach said ______ ______ was building up in her muscles.","zh":"400公尺賽跑到最後她的雙腿灼熱，而教練說是乳酸正在她的肌肉中累積。","part":"A","sec":"The Human Body & Anatomy 人體與解剖","lab":"A23","t":"乳酸"},{"w":"glycogen","pos":"n.","def":"the form in which the body stores sugar for energy","cn":"肝醣","s":"Marathon runners eat lots of pasta before a race, because their muscles need full stores of ________ for the long distance.","zh":"馬拉松跑者在賽前會吃很多義大利麵，因為他們的肌肉需要儲滿肝醣來應付長距離。","part":"A","sec":"The Human Body & Anatomy 人體與解剖","lab":"A24","t":"肝醣"},{"w":"metabolism","pos":"n.","def":"the chemical processes that turn food into energy","cn":"新陳代謝","s":"My ________ seems to slow down in winter, so I try to walk more and eat lighter meals when the weather gets cold.","zh":"我的新陳代謝似乎在冬天變慢，所以天氣變冷時我會試著多走路，並吃得清淡一點。","part":"A","sec":"The Human Body & Anatomy 人體與解剖","lab":"A25","t":"新陳代謝"},{"w":"metabolic","pos":"adj.","def":"relating to how the body uses energy","cn":"新陳代謝的","s":"Short, intense workouts raise your ________ rate for hours afterwards, so your body keeps burning extra energy while you rest.","zh":"短時間高強度的運動會讓你的代謝率在之後數小時保持升高，所以你的身體在休息時仍持續燃燒額外的能量。","part":"A","sec":"The Human Body & Anatomy 人體與解剖","lab":"A26","t":"代謝"},{"w":"muscle fibre","pos":"n.phr.","def":"one of the long thin cells that form a muscle","cn":"肌纖維","s":"Every ______ ______ gets tiny tears during heavy lifting, but the body repairs them and makes the muscle stronger.","zh":"每一條肌纖維在大重量訓練時都會產生微小撕裂，但身體會修復它們，讓肌肉變得更強壯。","part":"A","sec":"The Human Body & Anatomy 人體與解剖","lab":"A27","t":"肌纖維"},{"w":"fast-twitch","pos":"adj.","def":"describing muscle fibres that work quickly for short bursts","cn":"快縮型的","s":"Sprinters have many ________ muscle fibres, so they can explode out of the blocks, although they tire more quickly than distance runners.","zh":"短跑選手擁有許多快縮型肌纖維，所以他們能從起跑架爆發衝出，雖然他們比長跑選手更容易疲勞。","part":"A","sec":"The Human Body & Anatomy 人體與解剖","lab":"A28","t":"快縮型"},{"w":"slow-twitch","pos":"adj.","def":"describing muscle fibres that work for a long time without tiring","cn":"慢縮型的","s":"Long-distance cyclists rely on ________ fibres, because these muscles can keep working for hours while using oxygen efficiently.","zh":"長途自行車選手依賴慢縮型肌纖維，因為這些肌肉能在有效利用氧氣的同時持續運作好幾個小時。","part":"A","sec":"The Human Body & Anatomy 人體與解剖","lab":"A29","t":"慢縮型"},{"w":"warm-up","pos":"n.","def":"gentle exercise you do before hard exercise","cn":"熱身","s":"Never skip the ________ before a match, because cold muscles are much more likely to get injured when you suddenly sprint.","zh":"比賽前千萬不要省略熱身，因為冰冷的肌肉在你突然衝刺時更容易受傷。","part":"A","sec":"Training & Exercise 訓練與運動","lab":"A30","t":"熱身"},{"w":"cool-down","pos":"n.","def":"easy exercise you do after hard exercise to relax the body","cn":"緩和運動；收操","s":"After the race we did a ten-minute ________ of slow jogging and stretching, so our legs felt less stiff the next day.","zh":"比賽後我們做了十分鐘慢跑和伸展的緩和運動，所以第二天我們的腿比較不僵硬。","part":"A","sec":"Training & Exercise 訓練與運動","lab":"A31","t":"緩和運動"},{"w":"stretch","pos":"v.","def":"to make your muscles longer by reaching or bending","cn":"伸展；拉筋","s":"You should ________ your legs gently after running, but you should never bounce, because that can damage the muscle.","zh":"跑步後你應該輕柔地伸展雙腿，但絕對不要彈跳，因為那可能傷害肌肉。","part":"A","sec":"Training & Exercise 訓練與運動","lab":"A32","t":"伸展"},{"w":"endurance","pos":"n.","def":"the ability to keep doing a hard activity for a long time","cn":"耐力","s":"Cycling to school every day built up my ________, so I finished the five-kilometre fun run without stopping once.","zh":"每天騎腳踏車上學增強了我的耐力，所以我一次都沒停就跑完了五公里的趣味路跑。","part":"A","sec":"Training & Exercise 訓練與運動","lab":"A33","t":"耐力"},{"w":"strength training","pos":"n.phr.","def":"exercise that uses weights to make muscles stronger","cn":"肌力訓練","s":"My grandmother started ______ ______ at seventy, and now she can carry her own shopping bags up the stairs again.","zh":"我奶奶七十歲才開始做肌力訓練，而現在她又能自己提著購物袋上樓了。","part":"A","sec":"Training & Exercise 訓練與運動","lab":"A34","t":"肌力訓練"},{"w":"interval training","pos":"n.phr.","def":"exercise that mixes very hard periods with easy rest periods","cn":"間歇訓練","s":"______ ______ is popular with busy people, because thirty minutes of fast and slow running can be as useful as a longer jog.","zh":"間歇訓練很受忙碌的人歡迎，因為三十分鐘快慢交替的跑步可能和較長時間的慢跑一樣有效。","part":"A","sec":"Training & Exercise 訓練與運動","lab":"A35","t":"間歇訓練"},{"w":"weightlifting","pos":"n.","def":"the sport or activity of lifting heavy weights","cn":"舉重","s":"Taiwan has won several Olympic medals in ________, and many young athletes now train hard to lift even heavier weights.","zh":"台灣已在舉重項目贏得數面奧運獎牌，而現在許多年輕運動員努力訓練，想舉起更重的重量。","part":"A","sec":"Training & Exercise 訓練與運動","lab":"A36","t":"舉重"},{"w":"dumbbell","pos":"n.","def":"a short bar with a weight at each end, held in one hand","cn":"啞鈴","s":"I keep a pair of ________ under my bed, so I can do a few arm exercises while I watch videos at night.","zh":"我在床底下放了一對啞鈴，所以晚上看影片時可以做幾組手臂運動。","part":"A","sec":"Training & Exercise 訓練與運動","lab":"A37","t":"啞鈴"},{"w":"barbell","pos":"n.","def":"a long bar with heavy weights on both ends","cn":"槓鈴","s":"The coach added more plates to the ________ slowly, because lifting too much too soon can injure a young athlete's back.","zh":"教練慢慢地在槓鈴上加更多槓片，因為太快舉太重可能傷害年輕運動員的背部。","part":"A","sec":"Training & Exercise 訓練與運動","lab":"A38","t":"槓鈴"},{"w":"treadmill","pos":"n.","def":"a machine with a moving belt that you walk or run on","cn":"跑步機","s":"It was raining heavily outside, so I ran on the ________ at the gym, although I find indoor running quite boring.","zh":"外面下著大雨，所以我在健身房的跑步機上跑步，雖然我覺得室內跑步相當無聊。","part":"A","sec":"Training & Exercise 訓練與運動","lab":"A39","t":"跑步機"},{"w":"push-up","pos":"n.","def":"an exercise where you push your body up from the floor with your arms","cn":"伏地挺身","s":"Our PE teacher asked everyone to do twenty ________, but most of us could only manage ten before our arms started shaking.","zh":"我們的體育老師要求每個人做二十下伏地挺身，但我們大多數人只做了十下手臂就開始發抖。","part":"A","sec":"Training & Exercise 訓練與運動","lab":"A40","t":"伏地挺身"},{"w":"squat","pos":"n.","def":"an exercise where you bend your knees and lower your body","cn":"深蹲","s":"A deep ________ works almost every muscle in your legs, so many coaches call it the king of all exercises.","zh":"一個標準的深蹲幾乎能鍛鍊到你腿部的每一塊肌肉，所以許多教練稱它為所有運動之王。","part":"A","sec":"Training & Exercise 訓練與運動","lab":"A41","t":"蹲"},{"w":"lunge","pos":"n.","def":"an exercise where you step forward and bend both knees","cn":"弓箭步","s":"Do ten ________ on each leg slowly, and keep your back straight so that your knees do not hurt.","zh":"每條腿慢慢做十下弓箭步，並保持背部挺直，這樣你的膝蓋才不會痛。","part":"A","sec":"Training & Exercise 訓練與運動","lab":"A42","t":"弓箭步"},{"w":"plank","pos":"n.","def":"an exercise where you hold your body straight like a board","cn":"棒式","s":"I can hold a ________ for two minutes now, but at the beginning of the year I collapsed after only thirty seconds.","zh":"我現在能撐棒式兩分鐘，但年初時我只撐了三十秒就垮了。","part":"A","sec":"Training & Exercise 訓練與運動","lab":"A43","t":"棒式"},{"w":"repetition","pos":"n.","def":"one complete movement of an exercise","cn":"重複次數；一下","s":"Do twelve ________ of each exercise, and rest for one minute before you start the next set.","zh":"每個動作做十二下，並在開始下一組之前休息一分鐘。","part":"A","sec":"Training & Exercise 訓練與運動","lab":"A44","t":"下"},{"w":"cardio","pos":"n.","def":"exercise that makes your heart and lungs work harder","cn":"有氧運動","s":"I do thirty minutes of ________ three times a week, so I can run up the stairs at the MRT station without feeling tired.","zh":"我每週做三次、每次三十分鐘的有氧運動，所以我能跑上捷運站的樓梯而不覺得累。","part":"A","sec":"Training & Exercise 訓練與運動","lab":"A45","t":"有氧運動"},{"w":"jog","pos":"v.","def":"to run slowly and steadily for exercise","cn":"慢跑","s":"My parents ________ along the riverside park every evening, and they say it helps them sleep better at night.","zh":"我爸媽每天傍晚沿著河濱公園慢跑，而他們說這有助於他們晚上睡得更好。","part":"A","sec":"Training & Exercise 訓練與運動","lab":"A46","t":"慢跑"},{"w":"sprint","pos":"v.","def":"to run as fast as you can for a short distance","cn":"衝刺；全速奔跑","s":"The winger ________ down the left side of the field, and then he passed the ball to the striker in front of the goal.","zh":"那名邊鋒沿著球場左側全速衝刺，然後把球傳給球門前的前鋒。","part":"A","sec":"Training & Exercise 訓練與運動","lab":"A47","t":"全速衝刺"},{"w":"marathon","pos":"n.","def":"a running race of about 42 kilometres","cn":"馬拉松","s":"My aunt trained for six months before her first ________, and she finished the 42-kilometre race in just under five hours.","zh":"我阿姨在第一次馬拉松前訓練了六個月，而她以不到五小時的成績完成了這場42公里的賽跑。","part":"A","sec":"Training & Exercise 訓練與運動","lab":"A48","t":"馬拉松"},{"w":"cross-training","pos":"n.","def":"doing different types of exercise to stay fit","cn":"交叉訓練","s":"Runners often add swimming as ________, because it builds fitness without putting stress on their knees and ankles.","zh":"跑者常常加入游泳作為交叉訓練，因為它能增進體能而不會對膝蓋和腳踝造成壓力。","part":"A","sec":"Training & Exercise 訓練與運動","lab":"A49","t":"交叉訓練"},{"w":"resistance band","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a stretchy elastic band used for exercise","cn":"彈力帶","s":"A ______ ______ is cheap and light, so I pack one in my suitcase and keep exercising in my hotel room.","zh":"彈力帶便宜又輕巧，所以我把一條放進行李箱，在飯店房間裡繼續運動。","part":"A","sec":"Training & Exercise 訓練與運動","lab":"A50","t":"彈力帶"},{"w":"personal trainer","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a professional who plans exercise for one client","cn":"私人教練","s":"My dad hired a ______ ______ after his health check, and she designed a safe workout plan for his bad back.","zh":"我爸爸在健康檢查後請了一位私人教練，而她為他不好的背部設計了一套安全的運動計畫。","part":"A","sec":"Training & Exercise 訓練與運動","lab":"A51","t":"私人教練"},{"w":"gym","pos":"n.","def":"a room or building with equipment for exercise","cn":"健身房","s":"The new ________ near our school is open twenty-four hours, so my brother often goes there after his part-time job.","zh":"我們學校附近新開的健身房二十四小時營業，所以我哥哥常在打工後去那裡。","part":"A","sec":"Training & Exercise 訓練與運動","lab":"A52","t":"健身房"},{"w":"overtraining","pos":"n.","def":"training too much without enough rest, which harms performance","cn":"過度訓練","s":"Her times got slower every week because of ________, so her coach told her to take five full days off.","zh":"由於過度訓練，她的成績每週都變慢，所以教練要她休息整整五天。","part":"A","sec":"Training & Exercise 訓練與運動","lab":"A53","t":"過度訓練"},{"w":"regimen","pos":"n.","def":"a strict plan for training, diet or health","cn":"（嚴格的）養生法；訓練計畫","s":"The boxer follows a strict daily ________ of running, sparring and healthy meals, but he always rests on Sundays.","zh":"那位拳擊手遵循每日嚴格的訓練計畫，包括跑步、對打練習和健康飲食，但他星期天總是休息。","part":"A","sec":"Training & Exercise 訓練與運動","lab":"A54","t":"訓練計畫"},{"w":"anaerobic","pos":"adj.","def":"describing short, intense exercise that does not use much oxygen","cn":"無氧的","s":"Sprinting and heavy lifting are ________ activities, so you can only keep them up for a few seconds before you need a break.","zh":"衝刺和大重量訓練是無氧運動，所以你只能維持幾秒鐘就需要休息。","part":"A","sec":"Training & Exercise 訓練與運動","lab":"A55","t":"無氧"},{"w":"high-intensity","pos":"adj.","def":"very hard and fast","cn":"高強度的","s":"The ________ class at my gym lasts only twenty minutes, but everyone is soaked in sweat by the end.","zh":"我健身房的高強度課程只有二十分鐘，但到最後每個人都汗流浹背。","part":"A","sec":"Training & Exercise 訓練與運動","lab":"A56","t":"高強度"},{"w":"low-impact","pos":"adj.","def":"gentle and not putting much stress on the joints","cn":"低衝擊的","s":"Swimming is a ________ sport, so doctors often recommend it for older people and for anyone with knee problems.","zh":"游泳是一種低衝擊的運動，所以醫生常常推薦給年長者以及任何有膝蓋問題的人。","part":"A","sec":"Training & Exercise 訓練與運動","lab":"A57","t":"低衝擊"},{"w":"fitness tracker","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a wristband that records steps, sleep and heart rate","cn":"健身追蹤器；運動手環","s":"My ______ ______ reminds me to stand up every hour, because I often sit at my desk for too long while I study.","zh":"我的運動手環每小時提醒我站起來，因為我讀書時常常在書桌前坐太久。","part":"A","sec":"Training & Exercise 訓練與運動","lab":"A58","t":"運動手環"},{"w":"hydration","pos":"n.","def":"having enough water in your body","cn":"補水；水分充足","s":"Good ________ is important during summer training, so the coach puts cold water bottles beside the field every afternoon.","zh":"夏季訓練時良好的補水很重要，所以教練每天下午都在球場旁放冰水。","part":"A","sec":"Sports Nutrition & Recovery 運動營養與恢復","lab":"A59","t":"補水"},{"w":"hydrate","pos":"v.","def":"to drink enough water for your body","cn":"補充水分","s":"Remember to ________ before the race starts, because you may not find a water station until the fifth kilometre.","zh":"記得在比賽開始前補充水分，因為你可能要到第五公里才會找到補給站。","part":"A","sec":"Sports Nutrition & Recovery 運動營養與恢復","lab":"A60","t":"補充水分"},{"w":"rehydrate","pos":"v.","def":"to drink water again after losing a lot of it","cn":"重新補水","s":"The tennis players ________ with water and fruit between sets, because the court was over thirty-five degrees.","zh":"網球選手在局與局之間用水和水果補充水分，因為球場溫度超過三十五度。","part":"A","sec":"Sports Nutrition & Recovery 運動營養與恢復","lab":"A61","t":"補充水分"},{"w":"electrolyte","pos":"n.","def":"a salt in the body, like sodium, that helps muscles work","cn":"電解質","s":"You lose ________ when you sweat a lot, so a pinch of salt in your water can help prevent cramps.","zh":"你大量流汗時會流失電解質，所以在水裡加一小撮鹽有助於預防抽筋。","part":"A","sec":"Sports Nutrition & Recovery 運動營養與恢復","lab":"A62","t":"電解質"},{"w":"sports drink","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a drink with sugar and salts for people who exercise","cn":"運動飲料","s":"A ______ ______ can help during a long match, but for a short walk ordinary water is cheaper and healthier.","zh":"運動飲料在長時間的比賽中可能有幫助，但如果只是短程散步，一般的水更便宜也更健康。","part":"A","sec":"Sports Nutrition & Recovery 運動營養與恢復","lab":"A63","t":"運動飲料"},{"w":"protein shake","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a drink with a lot of protein, often taken after exercise","cn":"蛋白飲；高蛋白奶昔","s":"My brother drinks a ______ ______ after every gym session, because he believes it helps his muscles recover faster.","zh":"我哥哥每次健身後都會喝一杯高蛋白飲，因為他相信這能幫助肌肉更快恢復。","part":"A","sec":"Sports Nutrition & Recovery 運動營養與恢復","lab":"A64","t":"高蛋白飲"},{"w":"energy bar","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a small snack bar that gives quick energy","cn":"能量棒","s":"I always pack an ______ ______ for long hikes, because it is light and gives me energy when I feel weak.","zh":"我長途健行時總會帶一根能量棒，因為它很輕，而且在我感到無力時能補充能量。","part":"A","sec":"Sports Nutrition & Recovery 運動營養與恢復","lab":"A65","t":"能量棒"},{"w":"carb-loading","pos":"n.","def":"eating lots of carbohydrates before a long race","cn":"肝醣超補；賽前補碳水","s":"Many runners try ________ the night before a marathon, so pasta restaurants near the start line are always crowded.","zh":"許多跑者在馬拉松前一晚會嘗試賽前補碳水，所以起跑線附近的義大利麵餐廳總是擠滿了人。","part":"A","sec":"Sports Nutrition & Recovery 運動營養與恢復","lab":"A66","t":"賽前補碳水"},{"w":"rest day","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a day with no hard training, used to recover","cn":"休息日","s":"Even top athletes take a ______ ______ every week, because muscles actually get stronger while the body is resting.","zh":"即使是頂尖運動員每週也會安排一天休息日，因為肌肉其實是在身體休息時變強壯的。","part":"A","sec":"Sports Nutrition & Recovery 運動營養與恢復","lab":"A67","t":"休息日"},{"w":"ice bath","pos":"n.phr.","def":"sitting in very cold water to reduce muscle pain","cn":"冰浴","s":"After the final the players sat in an ______ ______ for ten minutes, and they screamed because the water was so cold.","zh":"決賽後球員們坐在冰浴裡十分鐘，而他們都尖叫了起來，因為水實在太冰了。","part":"A","sec":"Sports Nutrition & Recovery 運動營養與恢復","lab":"A68","t":"冰浴"},{"w":"ice pack","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a cold bag put on an injury to reduce swelling","cn":"冰敷袋","s":"The nurse put an ______ ______ on my swollen ankle, and she told me to keep my foot raised for an hour.","zh":"護理師在我腫起來的腳踝上放了一個冰敷袋，並叫我把腳抬高一個小時。","part":"A","sec":"Sports Nutrition & Recovery 運動營養與恢復","lab":"A69","t":"冰敷袋"},{"w":"foam roller","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a tube of hard foam you roll on to relax tight muscles","cn":"滾筒；泡沫軸","s":"I use a ______ ______ on my legs after running, and although it hurts a little, my muscles feel much looser afterwards.","zh":"我跑步後會用滾筒按摩雙腿，雖然有點痛，但之後肌肉感覺放鬆多了。","part":"A","sec":"Sports Nutrition & Recovery 運動營養與恢復","lab":"A70","t":"滾筒"},{"w":"physiotherapy","pos":"n.","def":"treatment of injuries with exercise and massage","cn":"物理治療","s":"He needed three months of ________ after his knee operation, but he was back on the football field by spring.","zh":"他膝蓋手術後需要三個月的物理治療，但到了春天他已經回到足球場上。","part":"A","sec":"Sports Nutrition & Recovery 運動營養與恢復","lab":"A71","t":"物理治療"},{"w":"physiotherapist","pos":"n.","def":"a person trained to treat injuries with exercise and massage","cn":"物理治療師","s":"The team ________ showed me some simple exercises for my shoulder, so I do them every morning before school.","zh":"球隊的物理治療師教了我一些簡單的肩膀運動，所以我每天早上上學前都會做。","part":"A","sec":"Sports Nutrition & Recovery 運動營養與恢復","lab":"A72","t":"物理治療師"},{"w":"sore","pos":"adj.","def":"painful, especially after exercise","cn":"痠痛的","s":"My legs were very ________ after my first yoga class, so I walked down the stairs slowly for two days.","zh":"第一次上瑜伽課後我的雙腿非常痠痛，所以我兩天都慢慢地走下樓梯。","part":"A","sec":"Sports Nutrition & Recovery 運動營養與恢復","lab":"A73","t":"痠痛"},{"w":"soreness","pos":"n.","def":"a feeling of pain in the muscles","cn":"痠痛感","s":"Muscle ________ usually peaks two days after a hard workout, so don't worry if you feel worse on the second morning.","zh":"肌肉痠痛通常在激烈運動後兩天達到高峰，所以如果你第二天早上覺得更糟也不用擔心。","part":"A","sec":"Sports Nutrition & Recovery 運動營養與恢復","lab":"A74","t":"痠痛"},{"w":"cramp","pos":"n.","def":"a sudden painful tightening of a muscle","cn":"抽筋","s":"The swimmer got a ________ in his leg halfway across the lake, but a lifeguard reached him quickly and helped him to the shore.","zh":"那位泳者游到湖中央時腿抽筋了，但救生員很快游到他身邊，幫助他上岸。","part":"A","sec":"Sports Nutrition & Recovery 運動營養與恢復","lab":"A75","t":"抽筋"},{"w":"caffeine","pos":"n.","def":"a substance in coffee and tea that makes you feel awake","cn":"咖啡因","s":"Some cyclists drink coffee before a race, because ________ can make them feel more alert and less tired.","zh":"有些自行車選手在比賽前喝咖啡，因為咖啡因能讓他們感覺更警覺、更不疲倦。","part":"A","sec":"Sports Nutrition & Recovery 運動營養與恢復","lab":"A76","t":"咖啡因"},{"w":"creatine","pos":"n.","def":"a natural substance taken to help with short, powerful exercise","cn":"肌酸","s":"Many weightlifters take ________ powder, but doctors say teenagers should talk to an expert before using any supplement.","zh":"許多舉重選手會服用肌酸粉，但醫生說青少年在使用任何補充品之前應該先諮詢專家。","part":"A","sec":"Sports Nutrition & Recovery 運動營養與恢復","lab":"A77","t":"肌酸"},{"w":"glucose","pos":"n.","def":"a simple sugar that the body uses for energy","cn":"葡萄糖","s":"Your brain and muscles both use ________ for fuel, so skipping breakfast can make you feel weak during morning PE class.","zh":"你的大腦和肌肉都以葡萄糖為燃料，所以不吃早餐可能讓你在早上的體育課感到無力。","part":"A","sec":"Sports Nutrition & Recovery 運動營養與恢復","lab":"A78","t":"葡萄糖"},{"w":"macronutrient","pos":"n.","def":"a nutrient we need in large amounts: protein, fat or carbohydrate","cn":"巨量營養素","s":"Every ________ has a different job, because carbohydrates give quick energy while protein helps to repair muscles.","zh":"每一種巨量營養素都有不同的作用，因為碳水化合物提供快速能量，而蛋白質幫助修復肌肉。","part":"A","sec":"Sports Nutrition & Recovery 運動營養與恢復","lab":"A79","t":"巨量營養素"},{"w":"power nap","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a short sleep of about 20 minutes to get energy back","cn":"能量小睡","s":"I take a ______ ______ after lunch on training days, and I feel much sharper during evening practice.","zh":"我在訓練日的午餐後會小睡片刻，而我在晚上練習時感覺精神好多了。","part":"A","sec":"Sports Nutrition & Recovery 運動營養與恢復","lab":"A80","t":"小睡片刻"},{"w":"compression garment","pos":"n.phr.","def":"tight clothing that presses on muscles to help blood flow","cn":"壓縮衣","s":"Many runners wear a ______ ______ on their legs after a race, because they believe it reduces swelling and pain.","zh":"許多跑者在比賽後會在腿上穿壓縮衣，因為他們相信這能減少腫脹和疼痛。","part":"A","sec":"Sports Nutrition & Recovery 運動營養與恢復","lab":"A81","t":"壓縮衣"},{"w":"taper","pos":"v.","def":"to train less in the days before an important race","cn":"（賽前）減量訓練","s":"Swimmers usually ________ for two weeks before the national championships, so their bodies are fresh on race day.","zh":"游泳選手通常在全國錦標賽前兩週減量訓練，所以他們在比賽當天身體狀態充沛。","part":"A","sec":"Sports Nutrition & Recovery 運動營養與恢復","lab":"A82","t":"減量訓練"},{"w":"bloodstream","pos":"n.","def":"the blood flowing around the body","cn":"血液循環；血流","s":"Sugar from a sports drink enters your ________ quickly, so you get energy within a few minutes.","zh":"運動飲料中的糖分很快進入你的血液，所以你在幾分鐘內就能獲得能量。","part":"A","sec":"Sports Nutrition & Recovery 運動營養與恢復","lab":"A83","t":"血液"},{"w":"dietitian","pos":"n.","def":"an expert who gives advice about food and diet","cn":"營養師","s":"The team ________ planned our meals for the tournament, so we ate rice, fish and vegetables instead of fried chicken.","zh":"球隊的營養師規劃了我們比賽期間的餐點，所以我們吃米飯、魚和蔬菜，而不是炸雞。","part":"A","sec":"Sports Nutrition & Recovery 運動營養與恢復","lab":"A84","t":"營養師"},{"w":"body fat","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the amount of fat in the body","cn":"體脂肪","s":"The gym machine measured my ______ ______, and the trainer said the number was healthy for someone my age.","zh":"健身房的機器測量了我的體脂肪，而教練說這個數字以我的年齡來說是健康的。","part":"A","sec":"Sports Nutrition & Recovery 運動營養與恢復","lab":"A85","t":"體脂肪"},{"w":"lean","pos":"adj.","def":"thin and healthy, with little fat","cn":"精瘦的","s":"Long-distance runners are usually very ________, because they burn a huge amount of energy during training every week.","zh":"長跑選手通常非常精瘦，因為他們每週訓練時都會燃燒大量的能量。","part":"A","sec":"Sports Nutrition & Recovery 運動營養與恢復","lab":"A86","t":"精瘦"},{"w":"whey protein","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a milk protein powder used to help muscles recover","cn":"乳清蛋白","s":"He mixes ______ ______ with milk after training, although a dietitian told him that ordinary food works just as well.","zh":"他訓練後把乳清蛋白和牛奶混在一起喝，雖然營養師告訴他普通食物效果一樣好。","part":"A","sec":"Sports Nutrition & Recovery 運動營養與恢復","lab":"A87","t":"乳清蛋白"},{"w":"sprain","pos":"n.","def":"an injury where a joint is twisted and hurt","cn":"扭傷","s":"She got a bad ________ while playing badminton, so she wore a support on her wrist for three weeks.","zh":"她打羽球時嚴重扭傷，所以她手腕戴了三週的護具。","part":"A","sec":"Injury, Health & Sports Medicine 運動傷害與運動醫學","lab":"A88","t":"扭傷"},{"w":"dislocate","pos":"v.","def":"to push a bone out of its normal place","cn":"脫臼","s":"The rugby player fell heavily and ________ his shoulder, so the doctor had to put the joint back in place.","zh":"那位橄欖球員重重跌倒，肩膀脫臼了，所以醫生必須把關節推回原位。","part":"A","sec":"Injury, Health & Sports Medicine 運動傷害與運動醫學","lab":"A89","t":"脫臼"},{"w":"fracture","pos":"n.","def":"a crack or break in a bone","cn":"骨折；裂傷","s":"The scan showed a small ________ in his foot, and he had to wear a boot for six weeks.","zh":"掃描顯示他腳部有一處小骨折，而他必須穿護具靴六週。","part":"A","sec":"Injury, Health & Sports Medicine 運動傷害與運動醫學","lab":"A90","t":"骨折"},{"w":"bruise","pos":"n.","def":"a dark mark on the skin caused by a knock","cn":"瘀青","s":"My knee had a huge purple ________ after the match, but luckily nothing was broken.","zh":"比賽後我的膝蓋有一大塊紫色的瘀青，但幸好沒有骨頭斷裂。","part":"A","sec":"Injury, Health & Sports Medicine 運動傷害與運動醫學","lab":"A91","t":"瘀青"},{"w":"swelling","pos":"n.","def":"the state of a body part becoming larger because of injury","cn":"腫脹","s":"Ice and rest reduced the ________ around my ankle, so I could put my shoe on again the next morning.","zh":"冰敷和休息減輕了我腳踝周圍的腫脹，所以隔天早上我又能穿上鞋子了。","part":"A","sec":"Injury, Health & Sports Medicine 運動傷害與運動醫學","lab":"A92","t":"腫脹"},{"w":"swollen","pos":"adj.","def":"larger than normal because of injury or illness","cn":"腫起來的","s":"His wrist was still ________ on Monday, so the coach told him to miss training until the pain had gone.","zh":"他的手腕星期一還是腫著，所以教練叫他暫停訓練，直到疼痛消失。","part":"A","sec":"Injury, Health & Sports Medicine 運動傷害與運動醫學","lab":"A93","t":"腫著"},{"w":"tear / tore / torn","pos":"v.","def":"to pull something apart or damage it by pulling","cn":"撕裂","s":"He felt something ________ in the back of his leg as he jumped, and the scan later showed a muscle injury.","zh":"他跳起時感覺大腿後側有東西撕裂，而後來的掃描顯示是肌肉受傷。","part":"A","sec":"Injury, Health & Sports Medicine 運動傷害與運動醫學","lab":"A94","t":"撕裂"},{"w":"limp","pos":"v.","def":"to walk with difficulty because one leg hurts","cn":"跛行","s":"He had to ________ off the field after the tackle, but he was running normally again within ten days.","zh":"那次擒抱後他只能跛著腳離場，但不到十天他又能正常跑步了。","part":"A","sec":"Injury, Health & Sports Medicine 運動傷害與運動醫學","lab":"A95","t":"跛著腳"},{"w":"stiff","pos":"adj.","def":"hard to move and a little painful","cn":"僵硬的","s":"My shoulders felt ________ after sleeping badly, so I did some gentle stretches before swimming practice.","zh":"睡不好之後我的肩膀感覺僵硬，所以我在游泳練習前做了一些輕柔的伸展。","part":"A","sec":"Injury, Health & Sports Medicine 運動傷害與運動醫學","lab":"A96","t":"僵硬"},{"w":"stiffness","pos":"n.","def":"the state of being hard to move","cn":"僵硬","s":"Morning ________ is common in older runners, but a warm shower and slow walking usually make it better.","zh":"早晨的僵硬在年長跑者中很常見，但洗個熱水澡和慢慢走動通常就能改善。","part":"A","sec":"Injury, Health & Sports Medicine 運動傷害與運動醫學","lab":"A97","t":"僵硬"},{"w":"numb","pos":"adj.","def":"unable to feel anything","cn":"麻木的","s":"My fingers went ________ during the winter race, so I wore thicker gloves for the next event.","zh":"冬季比賽中我的手指麻掉了，所以下一場比賽我戴了更厚的手套。","part":"A","sec":"Injury, Health & Sports Medicine 運動傷害與運動醫學","lab":"A98","t":"麻掉了"},{"w":"blister","pos":"n.","def":"a small painful bubble of skin, often from rubbing","cn":"水泡","s":"New running shoes gave me a painful ________ on my heel, so I covered it with a plaster before the race.","zh":"新跑鞋讓我的腳跟長了一個很痛的水泡，所以我在比賽前用膠布把它貼起來。","part":"A","sec":"Injury, Health & Sports Medicine 運動傷害與運動醫學","lab":"A99","t":"水泡"},{"w":"shin splints","pos":"n.phr.","def":"pain along the front of the lower leg from running","cn":"脛前疼痛","s":"Running on concrete every day gave her ______ ______, so she moved her training onto grass and the pain slowly faded.","zh":"每天在水泥地上跑步讓她得了脛前疼痛，所以她把訓練改到草地上，疼痛就慢慢消退了。","part":"A","sec":"Injury, Health & Sports Medicine 運動傷害與運動醫學","lab":"A100","t":"脛前疼痛"},{"w":"tennis elbow","pos":"n.phr.","def":"pain in the outside of the elbow from overuse","cn":"網球肘","s":"My father got ______ ______ from painting the house, and interestingly he had never played tennis in his life.","zh":"我爸爸因為粉刷房子而得了網球肘，而有趣的是他這輩子從沒打過網球。","part":"A","sec":"Injury, Health & Sports Medicine 運動傷害與運動醫學","lab":"A101","t":"網球肘"},{"w":"overuse injury","pos":"n.phr.","def":"damage caused by repeating the same movement too often","cn":"過度使用傷害","s":"Young pitchers often suffer an ______ ______ in the shoulder, so leagues now limit how many balls a child may throw.","zh":"年輕投手常常肩膀發生過度使用傷害，所以聯盟現在限制兒童可以投的球數。","part":"A","sec":"Injury, Health & Sports Medicine 運動傷害與運動醫學","lab":"A102","t":"過度使用傷害"},{"w":"sideline","pos":"v.","def":"to stop someone from playing because of injury","cn":"使無法上場","s":"The knee problem ________ their best defender for two months, and the team lost four games while he was away.","zh":"膝蓋問題讓他們最好的後衛無法上場兩個月，而他缺席期間球隊輸了四場比賽。","part":"A","sec":"Injury, Health & Sports Medicine 運動傷害與運動醫學","lab":"A103","t":"無法上場"},{"w":"relapse","pos":"n.","def":"the return of an illness or injury after it got better","cn":"復發","s":"He returned to training too early and suffered a ________, so this time he followed the doctor's advice carefully.","zh":"他太早回到訓練而導致傷勢復發，所以這次他仔細遵照醫生的建議。","part":"A","sec":"Injury, Health & Sports Medicine 運動傷害與運動醫學","lab":"A104","t":"復發"},{"w":"sports medicine","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the area of medicine dealing with exercise and injuries","cn":"運動醫學","s":"She studied ______ ______ at university, and now she treats injured players for a professional basketball team.","zh":"她在大學主修運動醫學，現在她為一支職業籃球隊治療受傷的球員。","part":"A","sec":"Injury, Health & Sports Medicine 運動傷害與運動醫學","lab":"A105","t":"運動醫學"},{"w":"team doctor","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the doctor who looks after a sports team","cn":"隊醫","s":"The ______ ______ ran onto the pitch within seconds, and she checked the player's head before letting him stand up.","zh":"隊醫在幾秒內就跑進球場，而她在讓那名球員站起來之前先檢查了他的頭部。","part":"A","sec":"Injury, Health & Sports Medicine 運動傷害與運動醫學","lab":"A106","t":"隊醫"},{"w":"first aid","pos":"n.phr.","def":"simple medical help given immediately after an injury","cn":"急救","s":"Every coach at our school must learn ______ ______, so someone can always help quickly if a student collapses.","zh":"我們學校每位教練都必須學會急救，這樣如果有學生倒下，總會有人能迅速幫忙。","part":"A","sec":"Injury, Health & Sports Medicine 運動傷害與運動醫學","lab":"A107","t":"急救"},{"w":"defibrillator","pos":"n.","def":"a machine that gives an electric shock to restart the heart","cn":"去顫器；電擊器","s":"A ________ on the wall of the sports hall saved a runner's life last year, because a teacher used it within two minutes.","zh":"去年體育館牆上的一台去顫器救了一位跑者的命，因為一位老師在兩分鐘內就使用了它。","part":"A","sec":"Injury, Health & Sports Medicine 運動傷害與運動醫學","lab":"A108","t":"去顫器"},{"w":"painkiller","pos":"n.","def":"a medicine that reduces pain","cn":"止痛藥","s":"Taking a ________ before a match can be dangerous, because you may not notice that an injury is getting worse.","zh":"比賽前服用止痛藥可能很危險，因為你可能不會察覺傷勢正在惡化。","part":"A","sec":"Injury, Health & Sports Medicine 運動傷害與運動醫學","lab":"A109","t":"止痛藥"},{"w":"anti-inflammatory","pos":"n.","def":"a medicine that reduces heat and swelling in the body","cn":"抗發炎藥","s":"The doctor gave him an ________ for his sore knee, but she also warned him not to take it for too long.","zh":"醫生給了他一種抗發炎藥來治療痠痛的膝蓋，但她也警告他不要服用太久。","part":"A","sec":"Injury, Health & Sports Medicine 運動傷害與運動醫學","lab":"A110","t":"抗發炎藥"},{"w":"MRI scan","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a detailed picture of the inside of the body made by a machine","cn":"磁振造影掃描","s":"The club sent him for an ______ ______, because the pain had not improved after ten days of rest.","zh":"俱樂部送他去做磁振造影掃描，因為休息十天後疼痛仍沒有改善。","part":"A","sec":"Injury, Health & Sports Medicine 運動傷害與運動醫學","lab":"A111","t":"磁振造影掃描"},{"w":"surgery","pos":"n.","def":"a medical operation","cn":"手術","s":"She needed ________ on her shoulder last winter, but she came back stronger and won the national title in June.","zh":"她去年冬天肩膀需要動手術，但她復出後更強，並在六月贏得全國冠軍。","part":"A","sec":"Injury, Health & Sports Medicine 運動傷害與運動醫學","lab":"A112","t":"手術"},{"w":"knee brace","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a support worn around the knee","cn":"護膝支架","s":"He played the whole season in a ______ ______, and he said it gave him the confidence to turn quickly again.","zh":"他整個球季都戴著護膝支架比賽，而他說這讓他有信心再次快速轉身。","part":"A","sec":"Injury, Health & Sports Medicine 運動傷害與運動醫學","lab":"A113","t":"護膝支架"},{"w":"crutch","pos":"n.","def":"a stick that helps an injured person walk","cn":"拐杖","s":"I used a ________ under each arm for two weeks, and my classmates kindly carried my bag to every lesson.","zh":"我兩邊腋下各用一支拐杖撐了兩週，而我的同學們親切地幫我把書包提到每一堂課。","part":"A","sec":"Injury, Health & Sports Medicine 運動傷害與運動醫學","lab":"A114","t":"拐杖"},{"w":"bandage","pos":"n.","def":"a long strip of cloth used to cover or support an injury","cn":"繃帶","s":"The trainer wrapped a tight ________ around his ankle, so he could finish the last ten minutes of the game.","zh":"訓練員在他的腳踝上纏了一條緊緊的繃帶，所以他能打完比賽最後的十分鐘。","part":"A","sec":"Injury, Health & Sports Medicine 運動傷害與運動醫學","lab":"A115","t":"繃帶"},{"w":"range of motion","pos":"n.phr.","def":"how far a joint can move","cn":"活動範圍","s":"Gentle exercises slowly improved the ______ ______ ______ in his shoulder, and after a month he could raise his arm fully.","zh":"輕緩的運動慢慢改善了他肩膀的活動範圍，而一個月後他能完全舉起手臂。","part":"A","sec":"Injury, Health & Sports Medicine 運動傷害與運動醫學","lab":"A116","t":"活動範圍"},{"w":"biomechanics","pos":"n.","def":"the study of how the body moves","cn":"生物力學","s":"Scientists used ________ to study her throwing action, and small changes to her elbow angle added two metres to her distance.","zh":"科學家用生物力學研究她的投擲動作，而手肘角度的微小改變讓她的距離增加了兩公尺。","part":"A","sec":"Biomechanics, Gear & Sports Technology 生物力學、裝備與運動科技","lab":"A117","t":"生物力學"},{"w":"gait","pos":"n.","def":"the way a person walks or runs","cn":"步態","s":"The shop filmed my ________ on a treadmill, and then the staff recommended shoes that suited the way my feet landed.","zh":"那家店在跑步機上拍下我的步態，然後店員推薦了適合我落地方式的鞋子。","part":"A","sec":"Biomechanics, Gear & Sports Technology 生物力學、裝備與運動科技","lab":"A118","t":"步態"},{"w":"stride length","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the distance covered in one step while running","cn":"步幅","s":"Increasing her ______ ______ made her faster at first, but it also tired her legs before the finish line.","zh":"加大步幅起初讓她跑得更快，但也讓她的雙腿在終點線前就疲累了。","part":"A","sec":"Biomechanics, Gear & Sports Technology 生物力學、裝備與運動科技","lab":"A119","t":"步幅"},{"w":"footwork","pos":"n.","def":"the way a player moves their feet in a sport","cn":"腳步動作","s":"Good ________ matters more than strength in badminton, because you must reach the shuttle before you can hit it well.","zh":"在羽球中好的腳步動作比力量更重要，因為你必須先接近球才能打得好。","part":"A","sec":"Biomechanics, Gear & Sports Technology 生物力學、裝備與運動科技","lab":"A120","t":"腳步動作"},{"w":"drag","pos":"n.","def":"the force of air or water that slows a moving body","cn":"阻力","s":"Cyclists ride close behind each other to reduce ________, so the rider at the front uses far more energy.","zh":"自行車手緊跟在彼此後面以減少阻力，所以最前面的車手消耗的能量多得多。","part":"A","sec":"Biomechanics, Gear & Sports Technology 生物力學、裝備與運動科技","lab":"A121","t":"阻力"},{"w":"aerodynamic","pos":"adj.","def":"shaped so that air passes over it easily","cn":"空氣力學的；流線的","s":"Her new helmet is more ________ than the old one, and the team says it saves several seconds over forty kilometres.","zh":"她的新頭盔比舊的更符合空氣力學，而車隊表示在四十公里的賽程中能節省好幾秒。","part":"A","sec":"Biomechanics, Gear & Sports Technology 生物力學、裝備與運動科技","lab":"A122","t":"符合空氣力學"},{"w":"centre of gravity","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the point where the weight of a body is balanced","cn":"重心","s":"Gymnasts keep their ______ ______ ______ low when they land, because a low body position helps them stay steady.","zh":"體操選手落地時會保持重心較低，因為低的身體姿勢能幫助他們站穩。","part":"A","sec":"Biomechanics, Gear & Sports Technology 生物力學、裝備與運動科技","lab":"A123","t":"重心"},{"w":"grip","pos":"n.","def":"the way you hold something, or the ability to hold it firmly","cn":"握法；抓力","s":"A looser ________ on the bat gives you faster hands, but you must still hold it firmly enough when you swing.","zh":"握球棒時握法放鬆一點能讓你的手更快，但揮棒時你仍必須握得夠緊。","part":"A","sec":"Biomechanics, Gear & Sports Technology 生物力學、裝備與運動科技","lab":"A124","t":"握法"},{"w":"traction","pos":"n.","def":"the grip of something on a surface","cn":"抓地力","s":"My old shoes had no ________ on the wet court, so I slipped twice during the first game.","zh":"我的舊鞋在濕滑的球場上沒有抓地力，所以我在第一局就滑倒了兩次。","part":"A","sec":"Biomechanics, Gear & Sports Technology 生物力學、裝備與運動科技","lab":"A125","t":"抓地力"},{"w":"cushioning","pos":"n.","def":"soft material that reduces the shock of landing","cn":"緩衝；避震","s":"Shoes with thick ________ protect your knees on hard roads, although some runners prefer a thinner, lighter sole.","zh":"有厚緩衝的鞋子能在堅硬路面上保護你的膝蓋，雖然有些跑者偏好較薄較輕的鞋底。","part":"A","sec":"Biomechanics, Gear & Sports Technology 生物力學、裝備與運動科技","lab":"A126","t":"緩衝"},{"w":"spike","pos":"n.","def":"a sharp point on the bottom of a sports shoe","cn":"釘鞋釘","s":"Each ________ on a sprinter's shoe digs into the track, so she can push off powerfully at the start.","zh":"短跑選手鞋底的每一根鞋釘都會抓進跑道，所以她在起跑時能強力推進。","part":"A","sec":"Biomechanics, Gear & Sports Technology 生物力學、裝備與運動科技","lab":"A127","t":"鞋釘"},{"w":"stud","pos":"n.","def":"a small lump on the bottom of a football boot","cn":"鞋釘；防滑釘","s":"He changed to longer ________ because the pitch was muddy, and after that he stopped sliding on every turn.","zh":"他換上較長的鞋釘，因為球場很泥濘，之後他每次轉身就不再滑了。","part":"A","sec":"Biomechanics, Gear & Sports Technology 生物力學、裝備與運動科技","lab":"A128","t":"鞋釘"},{"w":"helmet","pos":"n.","def":"a hard hat that protects the head","cn":"頭盔；安全帽","s":"Cycling without a ________ is dangerous, so our school will not let students join the road race unless they wear one.","zh":"不戴安全帽騎車很危險，所以除非學生戴上，我們學校不會讓他們參加公路賽。","part":"A","sec":"Biomechanics, Gear & Sports Technology 生物力學、裝備與運動科技","lab":"A129","t":"安全帽"},{"w":"mouthguard","pos":"n.","def":"a soft plastic shield worn to protect the teeth","cn":"護齒套","s":"Every player must wear a ________ in rugby, because a knock to the face can easily break a tooth.","zh":"橄欖球比賽中每位球員都必須戴護齒套，因為臉部受到撞擊很容易斷牙。","part":"A","sec":"Biomechanics, Gear & Sports Technology 生物力學、裝備與運動科技","lab":"A130","t":"護齒套"},{"w":"shin pad","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a hard cover that protects the front of the lower leg","cn":"護脛","s":"He forgot his ______ ______ before the game, so a teammate kindly lent him an old pair.","zh":"他比賽前忘了帶護脛，所以一位隊友好心借了他一副舊的。","part":"A","sec":"Biomechanics, Gear & Sports Technology 生物力學、裝備與運動科技","lab":"A131","t":"護脛"},{"w":"goggles","pos":"n.","def":"special glasses that protect the eyes","cn":"蛙鏡；護目鏡","s":"My ________ leaked during the race, so I could hardly see the lane rope for the last fifty metres.","zh":"比賽中我的蛙鏡漏水，所以最後五十公尺我幾乎看不見水道繩。","part":"A","sec":"Biomechanics, Gear & Sports Technology 生物力學、裝備與運動科技","lab":"A132","t":"蛙鏡"},{"w":"heart-rate monitor","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a device that measures how fast your heart beats","cn":"心率監測器","s":"A ______ ______ on his chest sends data to his phone, so he can see when he is training too hard.","zh":"他胸前的心率監測器會把資料傳到手機，所以他能看出自己何時訓練過度。","part":"A","sec":"Biomechanics, Gear & Sports Technology 生物力學、裝備與運動科技","lab":"A133","t":"心率監測器"},{"w":"wind tunnel","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a room where air is blown over a person to test their shape","cn":"風洞","s":"The cyclist spent a day in a ______ ______, and the engineers changed her riding position to cut the air resistance.","zh":"那位自行車手在風洞裡待了一天，而工程師調整了她的騎乘姿勢以減少空氣阻力。","part":"A","sec":"Biomechanics, Gear & Sports Technology 生物力學、裝備與運動科技","lab":"A134","t":"風洞"},{"w":"force plate","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a board that measures the push of a foot on the ground","cn":"測力板","s":"The jumper landed on a ______ ______, so the scientists could measure exactly how hard she pushed off.","zh":"那位跳躍選手落在測力板上，所以科學家能精確測量她蹬地的力量。","part":"A","sec":"Biomechanics, Gear & Sports Technology 生物力學、裝備與運動科技","lab":"A135","t":"測力板"},{"w":"high-speed camera","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a camera that records very fast movement in detail","cn":"高速攝影機","s":"A ______ ______ filmed his serve at a thousand frames a second, and the footage showed a small fault in his wrist.","zh":"高速攝影機以每秒一千格拍下他的發球，而影片顯示他手腕有個小瑕疵。","part":"A","sec":"Biomechanics, Gear & Sports Technology 生物力學、裝備與運動科技","lab":"A136","t":"高速攝影機"},{"w":"video analysis","pos":"n.phr.","def":"studying recorded film to improve performance","cn":"影像分析","s":"The team does ______ ______ every Monday, so the players can see their own mistakes instead of just hearing about them.","zh":"球隊每週一都做影像分析，所以球員能親眼看見自己的錯誤，而不只是聽別人說。","part":"A","sec":"Biomechanics, Gear & Sports Technology 生物力學、裝備與運動科技","lab":"A137","t":"影像分析"},{"w":"data-driven","pos":"adj.","def":"based on information and numbers","cn":"數據驅動的","s":"Modern coaching has become very ________, but good coaches still trust what they see with their own eyes.","zh":"現代的教練工作已變得非常數據驅動，但好的教練仍然相信自己親眼看到的東西。","part":"A","sec":"Biomechanics, Gear & Sports Technology 生物力學、裝備與運動科技","lab":"A138","t":"數據驅動"},{"w":"pedometer","pos":"n.","def":"a device that counts how many steps you take","cn":"計步器","s":"My grandfather carries a simple ________ in his pocket, and he walks around the block again if he has not reached ten thousand steps.","zh":"我爺爺口袋裡帶著一個簡單的計步器，如果還沒走到一萬步，他就會再繞街區走一圈。","part":"A","sec":"Biomechanics, Gear & Sports Technology 生物力學、裝備與運動科技","lab":"A139","t":"計步器"},{"w":"timing chip","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a small electronic tag that records a runner's race time","cn":"計時晶片","s":"Each runner wears a ______ ______ on one shoe, so the computer records the exact moment they cross the line.","zh":"每位跑者在一隻鞋上戴著計時晶片，所以電腦會記錄他們通過終點線的確切時刻。","part":"A","sec":"Biomechanics, Gear & Sports Technology 生物力學、裝備與運動科技","lab":"A140","t":"計時晶片"},{"w":"lane","pos":"n.","def":"one of the marked paths on a track or in a pool","cn":"跑道；水道","s":"She was given the outside ________ for the final, but she still swam a personal best and took the bronze.","zh":"她在決賽被分到最外側的水道，但她仍游出個人最佳成績並拿下銅牌。","part":"A","sec":"Biomechanics, Gear & Sports Technology 生物力學、裝備與運動科技","lab":"A141","t":"水道"},{"w":"artificial turf","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a surface of plastic grass used for sports","cn":"人工草皮","s":"Our school replaced the muddy field with ______ ______, so matches are no longer cancelled when it rains.","zh":"我們學校把泥濘的球場換成人工草皮，所以下雨時比賽不再被取消。","part":"A","sec":"Biomechanics, Gear & Sports Technology 生物力學、裝備與運動科技","lab":"A142","t":"人工草皮"},{"w":"floodlight","pos":"n.","def":"a very bright lamp that lights a sports field at night","cn":"探照燈；照明燈","s":"The new ________ let the team train after dark, and local families now come to watch the evening games.","zh":"新的照明燈讓球隊能在天黑後訓練，而當地家庭現在會來觀看晚間的比賽。","part":"A","sec":"Biomechanics, Gear & Sports Technology 生物力學、裝備與運動科技","lab":"A143","t":"照明燈"},{"w":"technical suit","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a special tight suit worn to swim faster","cn":"競技泳衣","s":"A ______ ______ can take twenty minutes to put on, and swimmers usually save it for their most important races.","zh":"一件競技泳衣可能要花二十分鐘才能穿好，而泳者通常把它留到最重要的比賽才用。","part":"A","sec":"Biomechanics, Gear & Sports Technology 生物力學、裝備與運動科技","lab":"A144","t":"競技泳衣"},{"w":"personal best","pos":"n.phr.","def":"your own fastest or highest result so far","cn":"個人最佳成績","s":"She did not win a medal, but she set a new ______ ______ by four seconds, so her coach was delighted.","zh":"她沒有拿到獎牌，但她把個人最佳成績推進了四秒，所以她的教練非常高興。","part":"A","sec":"Competition & Peak Performance 競賽與巔峰表現","lab":"A145","t":"個人最佳成績"},{"w":"world record","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the best result ever achieved in the world","cn":"世界紀錄","s":"The young swimmer broke the ______ ______ in the morning heats, and then she broke it again in the evening final.","zh":"那位年輕泳將在早上的預賽打破世界紀錄，接著又在晚上的決賽再次刷新它。","part":"A","sec":"Competition & Peak Performance 競賽與巔峰表現","lab":"A146","t":"世界紀錄"},{"w":"record-breaking","pos":"adj.","def":"better than anything done before","cn":"破紀錄的","s":"It was a ________ season for our school, because we won three regional titles for the first time ever.","zh":"這對我們學校來說是破紀錄的一季，因為我們首度贏得三個區域冠軍。","part":"A","sec":"Competition & Peak Performance 競賽與巔峰表現","lab":"A147","t":"破紀錄的"},{"w":"podium","pos":"n.","def":"the raised platform where the top three athletes stand","cn":"頒獎台","s":"Standing on the ________ with her parents watching was the proudest moment of her life, and she cried during the anthem.","zh":"在父母注視下站上頒獎台是她人生中最驕傲的時刻，而她在國歌響起時哭了。","part":"A","sec":"Competition & Peak Performance 競賽與巔峰表現","lab":"A148","t":"頒獎台"},{"w":"medallist","pos":"n.","def":"a person who has won a medal","cn":"獎牌得主","s":"An Olympic ________ visited our school last week, and she let every student hold her silver medal.","zh":"一位奧運獎牌得主上週造訪我們學校，而她讓每位學生都摸了她的銀牌。","part":"A","sec":"Competition & Peak Performance 競賽與巔峰表現","lab":"A149","t":"獎牌得主"},{"w":"qualify","pos":"v.","def":"to reach the standard needed to enter a competition","cn":"取得資格；晉級","s":"He had to run under eleven seconds to ________ for the national finals, and he managed it on his third attempt.","zh":"他必須跑進十一秒才能取得全國決賽資格，而他在第三次嘗試時成功了。","part":"A","sec":"Competition & Peak Performance 競賽與巔峰表現","lab":"A150","t":"取得 資格"},{"w":"qualifier","pos":"n.","def":"a match or race used to decide who enters a competition","cn":"資格賽","s":"Our team lost the first ________ badly, but we won the next two and reached the main tournament.","zh":"我們球隊第一場資格賽輸得很慘，但我們贏了接下來兩場並打進主賽。","part":"A","sec":"Competition & Peak Performance 競賽與巔峰表現","lab":"A151","t":"資格賽"},{"w":"heat","pos":"n.","def":"one of several early races used to choose the finalists","cn":"預賽","s":"She jogged easily through her ________ in the morning, because she wanted to save her energy for the final.","zh":"她早上輕鬆跑完預賽，因為她想為決賽保留體力。","part":"A","sec":"Competition & Peak Performance 競賽與巔峰表現","lab":"A152","t":"預賽"},{"w":"semi-final","pos":"n.","def":"the match before the final","cn":"準決賽","s":"Our volleyball team reached the ________ for the first time, although we lost to the eventual champions.","zh":"我們排球隊首次打進準決賽，雖然我們輸給了最終的冠軍。","part":"A","sec":"Competition & Peak Performance 競賽與巔峰表現","lab":"A153","t":"準決賽"},{"w":"knockout stage","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the part of a competition where the loser goes out","cn":"淘汰賽階段","s":"Once you reach the ______ ______, one bad afternoon can end your season, so every team plays very carefully.","zh":"一旦進入淘汰賽階段，一個下午的失常就可能結束你的球季，所以每支球隊都打得非常謹慎。","part":"A","sec":"Competition & Peak Performance 競賽與巔峰表現","lab":"A154","t":"淘汰賽階段"},{"w":"seeded","pos":"adj.","def":"ranked as one of the best players before a competition","cn":"種子的；排名的","s":"She was ________ second in the draw, so she did not have to face the top player until the final.","zh":"她在籤表中被列為第二種子，所以她直到決賽才需要面對頭號選手。","part":"A","sec":"Competition & Peak Performance 競賽與巔峰表現","lab":"A155","t":"種子"},{"w":"underdog","pos":"n.","def":"a player or team not expected to win","cn":"弱隊；不被看好的一方","s":"Everyone called us the ________ before the match, but we scored twice in the last ten minutes and won.","zh":"賽前每個人都說我們是不被看好的一方，但我們在最後十分鐘進了兩球並贏了。","part":"A","sec":"Competition & Peak Performance 競賽與巔峰表現","lab":"A156","t":"不被看好的一方"},{"w":"home advantage","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the benefit of playing in your own stadium","cn":"主場優勢","s":"______ ______ really matters in this league, because visiting teams must travel for six hours by bus.","zh":"主場優勢在這個聯賽真的很重要，因為客隊必須搭六小時的巴士。","part":"A","sec":"Competition & Peak Performance 競賽與巔峰表現","lab":"A157","t":"主場優勢"},{"w":"away game","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a match played at the opponent's ground","cn":"客場比賽","s":"We lost the ______ ______ by one goal, but we still went through because we had won at home.","zh":"我們客場比賽以一球落敗，但我們仍然晉級，因為我們在主場贏過。","part":"A","sec":"Competition & Peak Performance 競賽與巔峰表現","lab":"A158","t":"客場比賽"},{"w":"squad","pos":"n.","def":"the whole group of players a team can choose from","cn":"球隊名單；隊伍","s":"The coach named a ________ of eighteen players, so four of us had to watch the final from the stands.","zh":"教練公布了十八人的球隊名單，所以我們有四個人必須在看台上觀看決賽。","part":"A","sec":"Competition & Peak Performance 競賽與巔峰表現","lab":"A159","t":"球隊名單"},{"w":"line-up","pos":"n.","def":"the list of players chosen to start a match","cn":"先發陣容","s":"My name was in the starting ______ for the first time, and I was so excited that I could hardly sleep.","zh":"我的名字第一次出現在先發陣容中，而我興奮得幾乎睡不著。","part":"A","sec":"Competition & Peak Performance 競賽與巔峰表現","lab":"A160","t":"陣容"},{"w":"captain","pos":"n.","def":"the player who leads a team","cn":"隊長","s":"As ________, she encouraged the younger players after every mistake, so nobody was afraid to try something difficult.","zh":"身為隊長，她在每次失誤後都鼓勵較年輕的球員，所以沒有人害怕嘗試困難的動作。","part":"A","sec":"Competition & Peak Performance 競賽與巔峰表現","lab":"A161","t":"隊長"},{"w":"half-time","pos":"n.","def":"the break in the middle of a match","cn":"中場休息","s":"At ________ we were two goals behind, but the coach changed our shape and we scored three times after the break.","zh":"中場休息時我們落後兩球，但教練改變了陣型，而我們在下半場進了三球。","part":"A","sec":"Competition & Peak Performance 競賽與巔峰表現","lab":"A162","t":"中場休息"},{"w":"extra time","pos":"n.phr.","def":"additional playing time when the scores are equal","cn":"延長賽","s":"The game went to ______ ______, and both teams looked exhausted as they ran into the final minutes.","zh":"比賽進入延長賽，而兩隊跑到最後幾分鐘時都顯得筋疲力盡。","part":"A","sec":"Competition & Peak Performance 競賽與巔峰表現","lab":"A163","t":"延長賽"},{"w":"penalty shoot-out","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a way of deciding a drawn match by single kicks at goal","cn":"十二碼大戰","s":"Our goalkeeper saved two shots in the ______ ______, so the whole school celebrated for the rest of the week.","zh":"我們的守門員在十二碼大戰中擋下兩球，所以全校接下來一整週都在慶祝。","part":"A","sec":"Competition & Peak Performance 競賽與巔峰表現","lab":"A164","t":"十二碼大戰"},{"w":"runner-up","pos":"n.","def":"the person or team that finishes second","cn":"第二名","s":"She was the ________ at the city championships last year, but this season she finally took first place.","zh":"她去年在市錦標賽拿到第二名，但本季她終於奪得第一。","part":"A","sec":"Competition & Peak Performance 競賽與巔峰表現","lab":"A165","t":"第二名"},{"w":"debut","pos":"n.","def":"a player's first appearance for a team","cn":"初次登場","s":"He made his ________ at only sixteen, and he scored within twenty minutes of coming onto the pitch.","zh":"他年僅十六歲就初次登場，而他上場後二十分鐘內就得分了。","part":"A","sec":"Competition & Peak Performance 競賽與巔峰表現","lab":"A166","t":"初次登場"},{"w":"veteran","pos":"n.","def":"an experienced older player","cn":"老將","s":"The team's ________ played his last match on Sunday, and the crowd stood and clapped for a full minute.","zh":"球隊的老將星期天打了他的最後一場比賽，而觀眾全體起立鼓掌整整一分鐘。","part":"A","sec":"Competition & Peak Performance 競賽與巔峰表現","lab":"A167","t":"老將"},{"w":"rookie","pos":"n.","def":"a player in their first season","cn":"新人；菜鳥","s":"The ________ looked nervous in his first few games, but by December he was one of the best players in the league.","zh":"那位新人在頭幾場比賽看起來很緊張，但到十二月他已是聯賽中最好的球員之一。","part":"A","sec":"Competition & Peak Performance 競賽與巔峰表現","lab":"A168","t":"新人"},{"w":"outclass","pos":"v.","def":"to be much better than an opponent","cn":"技高一籌地擊敗","s":"The champions completely ________ us in the first half, so we were just happy to score once in the second.","zh":"冠軍隊在上半場徹底壓制我們，所以我們只為了下半場進一球就很高興了。","part":"A","sec":"Competition & Peak Performance 競賽與巔峰表現","lab":"A169","t":"壓制"},{"w":"prize money","pos":"n.phr.","def":"money given to the winners of a competition","cn":"獎金","s":"The ______ ______ in women's events is now equal at this tournament, and many players fought for years to achieve that.","zh":"這項賽事女子組的獎金現在已經同等，而許多選手為此奮鬥了多年。","part":"A","sec":"Competition & Peak Performance 競賽與巔峰表現","lab":"A170","t":"獎金"},{"w":"home crowd","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the supporters watching in their own stadium","cn":"主場觀眾","s":"The ______ ______ sang for ninety minutes, and the players said the noise made them run harder when they were tired.","zh":"主場觀眾唱了九十分鐘，而球員說那股聲浪讓他們在疲累時跑得更拚。","part":"A","sec":"Competition & Peak Performance 競賽與巔峰表現","lab":"A171","t":"主場觀眾"},{"w":"head-to-head","pos":"adj.","def":"directly against one other person or team","cn":"對決的；正面交鋒的","s":"Their ______ record is almost equal, so nobody could predict who would win Saturday's match.","zh":"他們的正面交鋒戰績幾乎相等，所以沒有人能預測星期六誰會贏。","part":"A","sec":"Competition & Peak Performance 競賽與巔峰表現","lab":"A172","t":"正面交鋒"},{"w":"mental toughness","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the ability to stay strong when things get hard","cn":"心理韌性","s":"______ ______ separates good players from great ones, because everyone can play well when the score is comfortable.","zh":"心理韌性區分了優秀與偉大的球員，因為在分數安全時每個人都能打得好。","part":"A","sec":"Sport Psychology, Fair Play & Society 運動心理、公平競賽與社會","lab":"A173","t":"心理韌性"},{"w":"mental imagery","pos":"n.phr.","def":"picturing a perfect performance in your mind","cn":"心像；心理想像","s":"She uses ______ ______ before every jump, so she pictures a perfect landing while she waits for her turn.","zh":"她在每次跳躍前都使用心像練習，所以她等待輪到自己時會想像完美的落地。","part":"A","sec":"Sport Psychology, Fair Play & Society 運動心理、公平競賽與社會","lab":"A174","t":"心像練習"},{"w":"self-talk","pos":"n.","def":"the words you say to yourself in your head","cn":"自我對話","s":"Positive ______ helped him through the last kilometre, because he kept repeating that he had trained for this moment.","zh":"正面的自我對話幫助他撐過最後一公里，因為他不斷重複說自己為這一刻訓練過。","part":"A","sec":"Sport Psychology, Fair Play & Society 運動心理、公平競賽與社會","lab":"A175","t":"自我對話"},{"w":"composure","pos":"n.","def":"the ability to stay calm under pressure","cn":"沉著；冷靜","s":"The young striker showed great ________ in front of goal, and he scored while three defenders were running at him.","zh":"那位年輕前鋒在球門前展現了極佳的沉著，而他在三名後衛衝向他時進了球。","part":"A","sec":"Sport Psychology, Fair Play & Society 運動心理、公平競賽與社會","lab":"A176","t":"沉著"},{"w":"morale","pos":"n.","def":"the level of confidence and hope in a group","cn":"士氣","s":"Team ________ dropped after four defeats, so the coach organised a barbecue and let the players simply enjoy themselves.","zh":"四連敗後球隊士氣低落，所以教練辦了一場烤肉，讓球員單純放鬆享受。","part":"A","sec":"Sport Psychology, Fair Play & Society 運動心理、公平競賽與社會","lab":"A177","t":"士氣"},{"w":"team spirit","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a feeling of loyalty and friendship within a team","cn":"團隊精神","s":"Our ______ ______ is the reason we keep winning, because every player works hard for the person beside them.","zh":"我們的團隊精神是我們持續獲勝的原因，因為每位球員都為身旁的隊友努力。","part":"A","sec":"Sport Psychology, Fair Play & Society 運動心理、公平競賽與社會","lab":"A178","t":"團隊精神"},{"w":"doping","pos":"n.","def":"the illegal use of drugs to improve sports performance","cn":"使用禁藥","s":"________ ruined the sport's reputation in the 1990s, and it took many years to win back the public's trust.","zh":"1990年代使用禁藥毀了這項運動的名聲，而要贏回大眾的信任花了很多年。","part":"A","sec":"Sport Psychology, Fair Play & Society 運動心理、公平競賽與社會","lab":"A179","t":"使用禁藥"},{"w":"drug test","pos":"n.phr.","def":"an examination to find out whether an athlete has taken banned drugs","cn":"藥檢","s":"Every medallist must take a ______ ______ immediately, so officials wait outside the changing room after each final.","zh":"每位獎牌得主都必須立刻接受藥檢，所以官員在每場決賽後都在更衣室外等候。","part":"A","sec":"Sport Psychology, Fair Play & Society 運動心理、公平競賽與社會","lab":"A180","t":"藥檢"},{"w":"performance-enhancing","pos":"adj.","def":"making an athlete stronger or faster, often illegally","cn":"提升表現的","s":"He was found with ________ drugs in his bag, so the federation removed his results from the record books.","zh":"有人在他的包裡發現提升運動表現的藥物，所以聯盟把他的成績從紀錄中刪除。","part":"A","sec":"Sport Psychology, Fair Play & Society 運動心理、公平競賽與社會","lab":"A181","t":"提升運動表現的"},{"w":"banned substance","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a drug that athletes are not allowed to use","cn":"禁用物質","s":"Her cold medicine contained a ______ ______, so she now checks every tablet with the team doctor first.","zh":"她的感冒藥含有禁用物質，所以她現在每顆藥都先請隊醫確認。","part":"A","sec":"Sport Psychology, Fair Play & Society 運動心理、公平競賽與社會","lab":"A182","t":"禁用物質"},{"w":"steroid","pos":"n.","def":"a drug that builds muscle quickly but harms health","cn":"類固醇","s":"Taking a ________ may add muscle fast, but it can damage the heart and liver within a few years.","zh":"服用類固醇可能快速增加肌肉，但它可能在幾年內損害心臟和肝臟。","part":"A","sec":"Sport Psychology, Fair Play & Society 運動心理、公平競賽與社會","lab":"A183","t":"類固醇"},{"w":"disqualify","pos":"v.","def":"to stop someone from taking part because of a rule break","cn":"取消資格","s":"The judges had to ________ him for stepping outside his lane, even though he had crossed the line first.","zh":"裁判必須因為他跨出跑道而取消他的資格，儘管他是第一個通過終點線的。","part":"A","sec":"Sport Psychology, Fair Play & Society 運動心理、公平競賽與社會","lab":"A184","t":"取消 資格"},{"w":"fair play","pos":"n.phr.","def":"honest and respectful behaviour in sport","cn":"公平競賽；運動家精神","s":"He kicked the ball back to the other team after the injury, and the crowd applauded his sense of ______ ______.","zh":"受傷事件後他把球踢回給對方球隊，而觀眾為他的運動家精神鼓掌。","part":"A","sec":"Sport Psychology, Fair Play & Society 運動心理、公平競賽與社會","lab":"A185","t":"運動家精神"},{"w":"match-fixing","pos":"n.","def":"arranging the result of a game dishonestly","cn":"作假比賽；打假球","s":"Two players were jailed for ________, and the league now trains every young professional about the risks.","zh":"兩名球員因打假球入獄，而聯盟現在會對每位年輕職業選手宣導其風險。","part":"A","sec":"Sport Psychology, Fair Play & Society 運動心理、公平競賽與社會","lab":"A186","t":"打假球"},{"w":"grassroots","pos":"adj.","def":"happening at a local, ordinary level","cn":"基層的","s":"________ sport needs more funding, because children in small towns often have no safe place to play.","zh":"基層運動需要更多經費，因為小鎮的孩子往往沒有安全的地方可以運動。","part":"A","sec":"Sport Psychology, Fair Play & Society 運動心理、公平競賽與社會","lab":"A187","t":"基層"},{"w":"scout","pos":"n.","def":"a person who looks for talented young players","cn":"球探","s":"A ________ from a professional club watched our school match, and he spoke to two of our defenders afterwards.","zh":"一位職業俱樂部的球探觀看了我們學校的比賽，而他之後找了我們兩名後衛談話。","part":"A","sec":"Sport Psychology, Fair Play & Society 運動心理、公平競賽與社會","lab":"A188","t":"球探"},{"w":"youth academy","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a school run by a club to train young players","cn":"青訓學院","s":"He joined the club's ______ ______ at thirteen, so he studied in the morning and trained every afternoon.","zh":"他十三歲就加入俱樂部的青訓學院，所以他早上讀書，每天下午訓練。","part":"A","sec":"Sport Psychology, Fair Play & Society 運動心理、公平競賽與社會","lab":"A189","t":"青訓學院"},{"w":"talent identification","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the process of finding young people with ability","cn":"選才；人才發掘","s":"Good ______ ______ looks at more than size and speed, because attitude and learning ability matter just as much.","zh":"良好的選才看的不只是身材和速度，因為態度和學習能力同樣重要。","part":"A","sec":"Sport Psychology, Fair Play & Society 運動心理、公平競賽與社會","lab":"A190","t":"選才"},{"w":"para-athlete","pos":"n.","def":"an athlete with a disability who competes in adapted sport","cn":"帕拉運動員","s":"The ________ swam the 100 metres faster than most people can run it, and the stadium rose to its feet.","zh":"那位帕拉運動員游完一百公尺的時間比大多數人跑的還快，而全場觀眾起立致敬。","part":"A","sec":"Sport Psychology, Fair Play & Society 運動心理、公平競賽與社會","lab":"A191","t":"帕拉運動員"},{"w":"Paralympics","pos":"n.","def":"the international sports competition for athletes with disabilities","cn":"帕拉林匹克運動會","s":"The ________ now attracts millions of viewers, and many of its stars have become household names at home.","zh":"帕拉林匹克運動會現在吸引數百萬觀眾，而它的許多明星已成為國內家喻戶曉的名字。","part":"A","sec":"Sport Psychology, Fair Play & Society 運動心理、公平競賽與社會","lab":"A192","t":"帕拉林匹克運動會"},{"w":"gender gap","pos":"n.phr.","def":"an unfair difference between men and women","cn":"性別差距","s":"There is still a ______ ______ in sports coverage, because women's matches receive far less television time.","zh":"運動報導上仍存在性別差距，因為女性賽事獲得的電視時段少得多。","part":"A","sec":"Sport Psychology, Fair Play & Society 運動心理、公平競賽與社會","lab":"A193","t":"性別差距"},{"w":"physical education","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the school subject in which students exercise and play sport","cn":"體育（課）","s":"______ ______ should be fun for everyone, because children who enjoy moving are far more likely to stay active as adults.","zh":"體育課應該讓每個人都覺得有趣，因為喜歡活動的孩子長大後更可能保持運動習慣。","part":"A","sec":"Sport Psychology, Fair Play & Society 運動心理、公平競賽與社會","lab":"A194","t":"體育課"},{"w":"spectator sport","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a sport that many people enjoy watching","cn":"觀賞性運動","s":"Baseball is the biggest ______ ______ in Taiwan, and families often spend a whole evening at the ballpark together.","zh":"棒球是台灣最大的觀賞性運動，而家庭常常一整個晚上都在球場一起度過。","part":"A","sec":"Sport Psychology, Fair Play & Society 運動心理、公平競賽與社會","lab":"A195","t":"觀賞性運動"},{"w":"sports science","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the study of the body and mind in sport","cn":"運動科學","s":"She studies ______ ______ at university, and her dream is to work with a national team at the Olympics.","zh":"她在大學念運動科學，而她的夢想是在奧運與國家隊共事。","part":"A","sec":"Sport Psychology, Fair Play & Society 運動心理、公平競賽與社會","lab":"A196","t":"運動科學"},{"w":"work ethic","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the habit of working hard and seriously","cn":"工作態度；努力的習慣","s":"His ______ ______ impressed the coaches more than his talent, because he was always the first to arrive at training.","zh":"他的努力態度比他的天賦更令教練印象深刻，因為他總是第一個到訓練場。","part":"A","sec":"Sport Psychology, Fair Play & Society 運動心理、公平競賽與社會","lab":"A197","t":"努力態度"},{"w":"pep talk","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a short encouraging speech before or during a match","cn":"激勵講話","s":"The coach gave a quiet ______ ______ at half-time, and the players walked out looking far more confident.","zh":"教練在中場休息時做了一段平靜的激勵講話，而球員走出場時看起來自信多了。","part":"A","sec":"Sport Psychology, Fair Play & Society 運動心理、公平競賽與社會","lab":"A198","t":"激勵講話"},{"w":"gamesmanship","pos":"n.","def":"the use of unfair tricks that are not quite against the rules","cn":"耍小手段","s":"Wasting time at the end of a match is ________, and most supporters dislike it even when their own team does it.","zh":"比賽尾聲拖延時間是一種耍小手段，而大多數球迷即使是自己球隊這麼做也不喜歡。","part":"A","sec":"Sport Psychology, Fair Play & Society 運動心理、公平競賽與社會","lab":"A199","t":"耍小手段"},{"w":"athleticism","pos":"n.","def":"natural physical skill, strength and speed","cn":"運動能力","s":"Her ________ amazed the scouts, but she still spent two seasons learning the tactics of the professional game.","zh":"她的運動能力讓球探驚嘆，但她仍花了兩個球季學習職業賽的戰術。","part":"A","sec":"Sport Psychology, Fair Play & Society 運動心理、公平競賽與社會","lab":"A200","t":"運動能力"},{"w":"appraisal","pos":"n.","def":"a careful judgement of how good or useful something is","cn":"評估；評價","s":"The club published an honest ________ of last season, and it admitted that the training schedule had been far too heavy.","zh":"俱樂部公布了對上一季誠實的評估，並承認訓練課表之前太過沉重。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B1","t":"評估"},{"w":"attainment","pos":"n.","def":"the act of reaching a goal or level","cn":"達成；成就","s":"The ________ of an Olympic place takes years of quiet work, and most of that work happens before anyone is watching.","zh":"達成奧運資格需要多年默默的努力，而大部分的努力都發生在沒人注意的時候。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B2","t":"達成"},{"w":"causality","pos":"n.","def":"the relationship between a cause and its result","cn":"因果關係","s":"The study found a link between sleep and speed, but proving ________ is much harder than showing a pattern.","zh":"這項研究發現睡眠與速度之間有關聯，但證明因果關係比顯示一種模式困難得多。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B3","t":"因果關係"},{"w":"compliance","pos":"n.","def":"the act of obeying a rule or request","cn":"遵守；合規","s":"________ with the new safety rules is checked every month, so coaches must keep records of every head injury.","zh":"每個月都會檢查新安全規定的遵守情況，所以教練必須記錄每一次頭部受傷。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B4","t":"遵守"},{"w":"conduit","pos":"n.","def":"a channel through which something passes","cn":"管道；通道","s":"The school website became the main ________ for training news, and parents checked it every Friday evening.","zh":"學校網站成了訓練消息的主要管道，而家長每週五傍晚都會查看。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B5","t":"管道"},{"w":"deliberation","pos":"n.","def":"careful thought or discussion before a decision","cn":"審慎考慮；商議","s":"After long ________ the committee changed the rule, but some older members still disagreed with the decision.","zh":"經過長時間的審慎討論後，委員會修改了規則，但一些資深成員仍不同意這個決定。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B6","t":"審慎討論"},{"w":"depiction","pos":"n.","def":"a description or picture of something","cn":"描繪；描寫","s":"The film's ________ of athletes' daily lives felt real, because the director had trained with the team for a year.","zh":"這部電影對運動員日常生活的描繪感覺很真實，因為導演曾與球隊一起訓練一年。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B7","t":"描繪"},{"w":"derivation","pos":"n.","def":"the origin of something, or where it comes from","cn":"由來；起源","s":"The ________ of the word \"marathon\" goes back to ancient Greece, and most runners enjoy hearing the story.","zh":"「marathon」這個字的由來可追溯到古希臘，而大多數跑者都喜歡聽這個故事。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B8","t":"由來"},{"w":"deterrence","pos":"n.","def":"the act of stopping people from doing something by frightening them","cn":"嚇阻","s":"Heavy fines work as ________ in most leagues, but a few players still take the risk every season.","zh":"高額罰款在大多數聯盟中發揮嚇阻作用，但每季仍有少數球員願意冒險。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B9","t":"嚇阻"},{"w":"differentiation","pos":"n.","def":"the process of showing or finding differences","cn":"區別；差異化","s":"Clear ________ between tiredness and injury is important, because resting a sore muscle is not the same as ignoring pain.","zh":"清楚區別疲勞和受傷很重要，因為讓痠痛的肌肉休息和忽視疼痛並不相同。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B10","t":"區別"},{"w":"dissemination","pos":"n.","def":"the spreading of information to many people","cn":"傳播；散布","s":"The ________ of the research took two years, so coaches in small towns learned about it much later.","zh":"這項研究的傳播花了兩年，所以小鎮的教練知道得晚得多。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B11","t":"傳播"},{"w":"diversification","pos":"n.","def":"the act of adding more different types of something","cn":"多樣化","s":"________ of a young athlete's sports is healthy, because playing several games builds different movement skills.","zh":"年輕運動員運動項目的多樣化是健康的，因為從事幾種運動能培養不同的動作技能。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B12","t":"多樣化"},{"w":"empowerment","pos":"n.","def":"the giving of power or confidence to people","cn":"賦權；增能","s":"The coach talks about ________ rather than control, so the players decide their own warm-up every Friday.","zh":"這位教練談的是賦權而不是控制，所以球員每週五自己決定熱身方式。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B13","t":"賦權"},{"w":"enactment","pos":"n.","def":"the act of making something into law","cn":"制定（法律）","s":"The ________ of the new concussion law changed school sport, and every coach now needs a short safety course.","zh":"新腦部撞擊法規的制定改變了校園運動，而現在每位教練都需要上一門短期安全課程。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B14","t":"制定"},{"w":"endowment","pos":"n.","def":"a large gift of money given to an institution","cn":"捐贈基金","s":"A former student left an ________ to the university, so poorer athletes can now train without worrying about fees.","zh":"一位校友留下一筆捐贈基金給大學，所以較貧困的運動員現在能訓練而不必擔心費用。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B15","t":"捐贈基金"},{"w":"enhancement","pos":"n.","def":"an improvement that makes something better","cn":"提升；增強","s":"A small ________ in recovery time can decide a championship, so teams study sleep as carefully as training.","zh":"恢復時間的小幅提升可能決定一個冠軍，所以球隊研究睡眠就像研究訓練一樣仔細。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B16","t":"提升"},{"w":"equivalence","pos":"n.","def":"the state of being equal in value or meaning","cn":"等同；相等","s":"There is no simple ________ between gym strength and game performance, because sport also needs timing and decision-making.","zh":"健身房裡的力量和比賽表現之間沒有簡單的等同關係，因為運動還需要時機掌握和決策能力。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B17","t":"等同關係"},{"w":"exemption","pos":"n.","def":"permission not to do or pay something","cn":"豁免；免除","s":"He was given an ________ from the fitness test because of his broken wrist, but he still attended every session.","zh":"因為手腕骨折，他獲得體能測驗的豁免，但他仍參加了每一次訓練。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B18","t":"豁免"},{"w":"exertion","pos":"n.","def":"great physical or mental effort","cn":"費力；用力","s":"After two hours of ________ in the heat, the players were given a long break and plenty of cold water.","zh":"在高溫下費力運動兩小時後，球員們獲得長時間休息和充足的冰水。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B19","t":"費力"},{"w":"extremity","pos":"n.","def":"the furthest part of something, such as a hand or foot","cn":"末端；肢端","s":"Blood flows away from each ________ in very cold weather, so your fingers and toes feel numb first.","zh":"在非常寒冷的天氣中血液會離開每個肢端，所以你的手指和腳趾最先感覺麻木。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B20","t":"肢端"},{"w":"formulation","pos":"n.","def":"the careful making of a plan, rule or product","cn":"制定；配方","s":"The ________ of a new training plan took weeks, because the coach wanted every athlete to have different targets.","zh":"新訓練計畫的制定花了好幾週，因為教練希望每位運動員都有不同的目標。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B21","t":"制定"},{"w":"implementation","pos":"n.","def":"the act of putting a plan into action","cn":"實施；執行","s":"The idea was popular, but its ________ failed because the school did not have enough qualified staff.","zh":"這個想法很受歡迎，但它的執行失敗了，因為學校沒有足夠的合格人員。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B22","t":"執行"},{"w":"imposition","pos":"n.","def":"the act of forcing a rule or burden on people","cn":"強加；施加","s":"The ________ of a daily weigh-in upset the swimmers, so the coach quickly dropped the idea.","zh":"強制施行每日量體重讓泳者們不悅，所以教練很快就放棄了這個想法。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B23","t":"強制施行"},{"w":"inversion","pos":"n.","def":"a change that puts something the opposite way round","cn":"顛倒；倒轉","s":"The chart showed an ________ of the usual pattern, because the younger group recovered more slowly than the older one.","zh":"圖表顯示了常見模式的顛倒，因為較年輕的組別恢復得比年長組別慢。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B24","t":"顛倒"},{"w":"mediation","pos":"n.","def":"the act of helping two sides reach an agreement","cn":"調解；居中協調","s":"After weeks of argument, ________ by the league finally settled the dispute between the club and its captain.","zh":"經過數週爭論後，聯盟的調解終於解決了俱樂部與其隊長之間的糾紛。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B25","t":"調解"},{"w":"nomenclature","pos":"n.","def":"the system of names used in a subject","cn":"命名體系；術語","s":"Medical ________ can confuse young athletes, so the physiotherapist explains every injury in simple words.","zh":"醫學術語可能讓年輕運動員困惑，所以物理治療師用簡單的話解釋每一種傷勢。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B26","t":"術語"},{"w":"optimisation","pos":"n.","def":"the act of making something as good as possible","cn":"最佳化","s":"________ of equipment helps a little, but hard training and good sleep still matter far more.","zh":"裝備的最佳化有一點幫助，但刻苦訓練和良好睡眠仍然重要得多。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B27","t":"最佳化"},{"w":"periphery","pos":"n.","def":"the outer edge of an area","cn":"周邊；邊緣","s":"Spectators stood around the ________ of the field, and some children climbed trees to see the finish.","zh":"觀眾站在球場周邊，而一些孩子爬上樹想看終點。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B28","t":"周邊"},{"w":"predominance","pos":"n.","def":"the state of being the largest or strongest part","cn":"佔多數；主導地位","s":"The ________ of slow-twitch fibres in her legs explains why she is better at long races than short ones.","zh":"她腿部慢縮型肌纖維的佔多數解釋了為什麼她長距離比賽比短距離更出色。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B29","t":"佔多數"},{"w":"groundswell","pos":"n.","def":"a growing feeling or movement among many people","cn":"風潮；浪潮","s":"There is now a ________ of support for free school sport, so several politicians have promised extra funding.","zh":"現在出現了一股支持免費校園運動的浪潮，所以好幾位政治人物已承諾增加經費。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B30","t":"浪潮"},{"w":"regression","pos":"n.","def":"a return to a worse or earlier state","cn":"退步；倒退","s":"A short ________ in performance is normal after illness, so do not panic if your times get slower.","zh":"生病後表現短暫退步是正常的，所以如果你的成績變慢也不要慌張。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B31","t":"退步"},{"w":"rejection","pos":"n.","def":"the act of refusing to accept something","cn":"拒絕","s":"His ________ by the youth academy hurt at first, but he joined a local club and improved quickly.","zh":"青訓學院的拒絕起初讓他很受傷，但他加入了當地俱樂部並迅速進步。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B32","t":"拒絕"},{"w":"replication","pos":"n.","def":"the act of repeating a study to check its results","cn":"重複驗證","s":"________ of the experiment in three different countries gave the findings much greater weight, so coaches finally trusted them.","zh":"在三個不同國家對這項實驗的重複驗證讓研究結果更有份量，所以教練終於信任它們。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B33","t":"重複驗證"},{"w":"revision","pos":"n.","def":"a change made to improve something","cn":"修訂；修改","s":"After one ________ of the rules, matches became safer, and the number of head injuries fell by a third.","zh":"在規則經過一次修訂後，比賽變得更安全，而頭部受傷的次數減少了三分之一。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B34","t":"修訂"},{"w":"saturation","pos":"n.","def":"the state of being completely full","cn":"飽和","s":"Oxygen ________ in the blood drops at altitude, so new arrivals often feel breathless for several days.","zh":"血液中的氧飽和度在高海拔會下降，所以剛抵達的人常常好幾天都感到呼吸困難。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B35","t":"飽和度"},{"w":"segregation","pos":"n.","def":"the act of keeping groups separate","cn":"隔離；區隔","s":"Strict ________ of boys and girls in school sport is now rare, and many games are played in mixed teams.","zh":"校園運動中男女嚴格區隔現在已很少見，而許多比賽是以混合隊伍進行的。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B36","t":"區隔"},{"w":"simplification","pos":"n.","def":"the act of making something easier to understand","cn":"簡化","s":"Some ________ is useful when teaching children, but telling them that fat is always bad is simply untrue.","zh":"教孩子時適度簡化是有用的，但告訴他們脂肪總是不好的根本不是事實。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B37","t":"簡化"},{"w":"specification","pos":"n.","def":"a detailed description of how something should be made","cn":"規格；規範","s":"The ball must meet an exact ________ for weight and size, so every match ball is tested before use.","zh":"球必須符合重量和尺寸的精確規格，所以每顆比賽用球在使用前都會檢測。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B38","t":"規格"},{"w":"stipulation","pos":"n.","def":"a condition that must be accepted","cn":"規定；條件","s":"The sponsor added one ________ to the contract, and the club had to display its logo on every shirt.","zh":"贊助商在合約中加了一項規定，而俱樂部必須在每件球衣上展示其標誌。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B39","t":"規定"},{"w":"subjectivity","pos":"n.","def":"the state of being based on personal feelings","cn":"主觀性","s":"________ in judging is unavoidable in gymnastics, so several judges score each routine and the extremes are removed.","zh":"體操評分中的主觀性無法避免，所以每套動作由多位裁判評分，並去掉最高與最低分。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B40","t":"主觀性"},{"w":"substitution","pos":"n.","def":"the act of replacing one thing with another","cn":"替換；代換","s":"The ________ of water for sugary drinks improved the team's dental health within a single season.","zh":"用水替換含糖飲料在短短一季內就改善了球隊的牙齒健康。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B41","t":"替換"},{"w":"subtlety","pos":"n.","def":"a small detail that is not easy to notice","cn":"細微之處","s":"The ________ of her technique is hard to see at full speed, but slow-motion film shows it clearly.","zh":"她技術的細微之處在全速下很難看出，但慢動作影片能清楚呈現。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B42","t":"細微之處"},{"w":"succession","pos":"n.","def":"a number of things or people following one after another","cn":"連續；接續","s":"A ________ of cold, wet matches left half the squad coughing, so the coach cut training for a week.","zh":"連續幾場寒冷潮濕的比賽讓半數隊員咳嗽，所以教練把訓練減少了一週。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B43","t":"連續"},{"w":"supervision","pos":"n.","def":"the act of watching and directing an activity","cn":"監督；指導","s":"Young children should lift weights only under ________, because poor technique can harm growing bones.","zh":"幼童只應在監督下舉重，因為錯誤的動作可能傷害發育中的骨骼。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B44","t":"監督"},{"w":"synthesis","pos":"n.","def":"the combining of different ideas into one whole","cn":"綜合；整合","s":"Her book is a ________ of research and practice, and coaches say it is the clearest guide they have read.","zh":"她的書是研究與實務的綜合，而教練們說這是他們讀過最清楚的指南。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B45","t":"綜合"},{"w":"uniformity","pos":"n.","def":"the state of being the same everywhere","cn":"一致性；統一","s":"There is little ________ in school sports funding, so some students train on grass while others use car parks.","zh":"校園運動經費缺乏一致性，所以有些學生在草地上訓練，其他人卻用停車場。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B46","t":"一致性"},{"w":"utilisation","pos":"n.","def":"the act of using something effectively","cn":"利用；運用","s":"Better ________ of the school gym would help everyone, because the room sits empty most mornings.","zh":"更好地利用學校健身房會對大家都有幫助，因為那間房間大多數早上都空著。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B47","t":"利用"},{"w":"prerogative","pos":"n.","def":"a special right belonging to one person or group","cn":"特權","s":"Choosing the starting team is the coach's ________, although she usually listens to her senior players first.","zh":"選擇先發球員是教練的特權，雖然她通常會先聽取資深球員的意見。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B48","t":"特權"},{"w":"stewardship","pos":"n.","def":"the careful management of something you are responsible for","cn":"管理責任；監管","s":"Under her ________ the club built a new pitch, and membership doubled within three years.","zh":"在她的管理下，俱樂部建了一座新球場，而會員人數在三年內增加了一倍。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B49","t":"管理"},{"w":"typology","pos":"n.","def":"a system of grouping things by type","cn":"類型學；分類系統","s":"The researchers created a simple ________ of runners, and they grouped athletes by how their feet landed.","zh":"研究人員建立了一套簡單的跑者分類系統，並依腳部落地方式將運動員分組。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B50","t":"分類系統"},{"w":"sample size","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the number of people or things studied","cn":"樣本數","s":"The ______ ______ was only twelve athletes, so the results are interesting but we should not trust them completely.","zh":"樣本數只有十二位運動員，所以這些結果很有趣，但我們不應完全相信。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B51","t":"樣本數"},{"w":"control group","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a group that does not receive the treatment being tested","cn":"對照組","s":"One group drank the new sports drink while the ______ ______ drank plain water, and both groups ran the same distance.","zh":"一組喝新的運動飲料，而對照組喝白開水，兩組都跑了相同的距離。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B52","t":"對照組"},{"w":"margin of error","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the amount by which a result may be wrong","cn":"誤差範圍","s":"The timing system has a tiny ______ ______ ______, but in sprinting even one hundredth of a second matters.","zh":"計時系統有極小的誤差範圍，但在短跑中即使百分之一秒也很重要。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B53","t":"誤差範圍"},{"w":"case study","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a detailed study of one person or situation","cn":"個案研究","s":"The textbook includes a ______ ______ of one injured swimmer, and it follows her recovery over eighteen months.","zh":"這本教科書包含一位受傷泳者的個案研究，並追蹤她十八個月的康復過程。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B54","t":"個案研究"},{"w":"raw data","pos":"n.phr.","def":"information collected before it has been organised","cn":"原始資料","s":"The team published its ______ ______ online, so other scientists could check the calculations themselves.","zh":"團隊把原始資料公布在網路上，讓其他科學家能自己核對計算。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B55","t":"原始資料"},{"w":"body of evidence","pos":"n.phr.","def":"all the information that supports an idea","cn":"眾多證據","s":"A large ______ ______ ______ now supports daily exercise, and doctors recommend it for almost every age group.","zh":"現在有大量的證據支持每日運動，而醫生幾乎為每個年齡層推薦它。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B56","t":"證據"},{"w":"frame of reference","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the set of ideas you use to judge something","cn":"參考框架","s":"Young players have a narrow ______ ______ ______, so they often think their own club's method is the only one.","zh":"年輕球員的參考框架較狹窄，所以他們常以為自己俱樂部的方法是唯一的。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B57","t":"參考框架"},{"w":"line of reasoning","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the series of steps in an argument","cn":"推理思路","s":"Her ______ ______ ______ was easy to follow, and by the end even the doubters agreed with her conclusion.","zh":"她的推理思路很容易理解，而到最後連懷疑的人也同意她的結論。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B58","t":"推理思路"},{"w":"working hypothesis","pos":"n.phr.","def":"an idea used as a starting point for research","cn":"工作假設","s":"Their ______ ______ was that cold baths speed up recovery, but the first results did not support it.","zh":"他們的工作假設是冰浴能加速恢復，但最初的結果並不支持它。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B59","t":"工作假設"},{"w":"placebo effect","pos":"n.phr.","def":"an improvement caused by belief rather than real treatment","cn":"安慰劑效應","s":"Some of the benefit may be the ______ ______, because athletes feel stronger simply when they expect to.","zh":"部分效果可能是安慰劑效應，因為運動員只要預期會變強就會感覺更強。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B60","t":"安慰劑效應"},{"w":"antipathy","pos":"n.","def":"a strong feeling of dislike","cn":"反感；厭惡","s":"His ________ towards running came from school, where PE lessons had been a punishment rather than a pleasure.","zh":"他對跑步的反感源自學校，當時體育課是一種處罰而不是樂趣。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B61","t":"反感"},{"w":"remit","pos":"n.","def":"the area of work a person or group is responsible for","cn":"職責範圍","s":"Injury prevention is outside the referee's ________, but she still warned the players about the slippery surface.","zh":"預防受傷不在裁判的職責範圍內，但她還是提醒球員注意濕滑的場地。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B62","t":"職責範圍"},{"w":"legislature","pos":"n.","def":"the group of people who make a country's laws","cn":"立法機關","s":"The ________ voted to fund school sport, and new gyms opened in dozens of rural towns.","zh":"立法機關投票通過資助校園運動，而數十個偏鄉小鎮開設了新的體育館。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B63","t":"立法機關"},{"w":"upside","pos":"n.","def":"the positive side of a situation","cn":"好的一面；優點","s":"The ________ of her long injury was extra study time, so she finished the year with excellent grades.","zh":"她長期受傷好的一面是多出了讀書時間，所以她那一年成績優異。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B64","t":"好的一面"},{"w":"touchstone","pos":"n.","def":"a standard used for judging other things","cn":"判斷標準；試金石","s":"That final has become a ________ for great matches, and commentators still compare new games with it.","zh":"那場決賽已成為精彩比賽的試金石，而評論員至今仍把新比賽與它相比。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B65","t":"試金石"},{"w":"knock-on effect","pos":"n.phr.","def":"an indirect result that follows something else","cn":"連帶影響","s":"Closing the pool had a ______ ______, because the swimming club lost half of its younger members.","zh":"關閉游泳池造成了連帶影響，因為游泳社團失去了一半的年輕成員。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B66","t":"連帶影響"},{"w":"ripple effect","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a spreading series of results from one event","cn":"漣漪效應","s":"One local champion created a ______ ______, and the number of children joining the club tripled.","zh":"一位當地冠軍帶來了漣漪效應，而加入社團的孩子人數增加了三倍。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B67","t":"漣漪效應"},{"w":"false positive","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a test result that wrongly shows something is there","cn":"偽陽性","s":"The first test was a ______ ______, so his name was cleared after a second sample was examined.","zh":"第一次檢測是偽陽性，所以在第二份樣本檢驗後他的名聲得以恢復。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B68","t":"偽陽性"},{"w":"trend line","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a line on a graph showing the general direction of change","cn":"趨勢線","s":"The ______ ______ on the chart rises slowly, so her fitness is improving even though single tests go up and down.","zh":"圖表上的趨勢線緩慢上升，所以她的體能正在進步，儘管單次測驗時高時低。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B69","t":"趨勢線"},{"w":"average","pos":"n.","def":"the usual amount, found by adding and dividing","cn":"平均值","s":"Her ________ over ten races was strong, but her best single run was more than a second faster.","zh":"她十場比賽的平均成績很好，但她單場最佳的一次快了一秒多。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B70","t":"平均成績"},{"w":"time frame","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the period during which something happens","cn":"時程；時間範圍","s":"The doctor gave a ______ ______ of eight weeks, and he reminded her that bones heal at different speeds.","zh":"醫生給出八週的時程，並提醒她骨頭癒合的速度各有不同。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B71","t":"時程"},{"w":"data point","pos":"n.phr.","def":"one single piece of information in a set","cn":"資料點","s":"A single ______ ______ proves nothing, so the scientists collected measurements every week for two years.","zh":"單一資料點無法證明任何事，所以科學家連續兩年每週收集數據。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B72","t":"資料點"},{"w":"contributing factor","pos":"n.phr.","def":"one of several causes of a result","cn":"促成因素","s":"Poor sleep was only one ______ ______, because the players had also travelled for nine hours that day.","zh":"睡眠不足只是其中一個促成因素，因為球員們那天還旅行了九個小時。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B73","t":"促成因素"},{"w":"causal link","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a connection in which one thing makes another happen","cn":"因果關聯","s":"Scientists have not proved a ______ ______ between the supplement and faster recovery, so they urge athletes to be careful.","zh":"科學家尚未證明這種補充品與恢復更快之間有因果關聯，所以他們呼籲運動員謹慎。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B74","t":"因果關聯"},{"w":"proxy","pos":"n.","def":"something used to represent or measure another thing","cn":"替代指標","s":"Resting heart rate is often used as a ________ for fitness, although it is affected by stress and sleep too.","zh":"靜止心率常被用作體能的替代指標，雖然它也受到壓力和睡眠影響。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B75","t":"替代指標"},{"w":"predictor","pos":"n.","def":"something that shows what is likely to happen","cn":"預測指標","s":"Grip strength is a surprisingly good ________ of general health, so doctors now measure it during check-ups.","zh":"握力是整體健康令人意外的好預測指標，所以醫生現在在健康檢查時會測量它。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B76","t":"預測指標"},{"w":"best practice","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the methods accepted as the most effective","cn":"最佳做法","s":"The federation published a guide to ______ ______, and every club received a printed copy by post.","zh":"聯盟出版了一本最佳做法指南，而每個俱樂部都收到一本郵寄的印刷版。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B77","t":"最佳做法"},{"w":"key finding","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the most important result of a study","cn":"主要發現","s":"The ______ ______ was simple: athletes who slept nine hours were injured far less often than those who slept six.","zh":"主要發現很簡單：睡九小時的運動員受傷的次數遠少於睡六小時的人。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B78","t":"主要發現"},{"w":"pilot study","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a small study done before a larger one","cn":"先導研究","s":"The ______ ______ involved just one school, but its promising results led to a national project.","zh":"這項先導研究只涉及一所學校，但它可期的結果促成了一項全國計畫。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B79","t":"先導研究"},{"w":"follow-up study","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a later study that checks earlier results","cn":"後續研究","s":"A ______ ______ five years later found that most of the young runners were still active.","zh":"五年後的一項後續研究發現，大多數年輕跑者仍保持運動習慣。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B80","t":"後續研究"},{"w":"advisable","pos":"adj.","def":"sensible and worth doing","cn":"明智的；可取的","s":"It is ________ to see a doctor before starting hard training, especially if you have not exercised for years.","zh":"開始激烈訓練前去看醫生是明智的，尤其如果你已經好幾年沒運動。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B81","t":"明智的"},{"w":"alleged","pos":"adj.","def":"said to be true but not yet proved","cn":"被指稱的","s":"The ________ rule-breaking was reported in every newspaper, but the hearing cleared the player two months later.","zh":"被指稱的違規行為登上了每家報紙，但兩個月後的聽證會還了那位球員清白。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B82","t":"被指稱的"},{"w":"attributable","pos":"adj.","def":"able to be explained as being caused by something","cn":"可歸因於…的","s":"Most of her improvement is ________ to better sleep, although she also changed her diet last winter.","zh":"她大部分的進步可歸因於更好的睡眠，雖然她去年冬天也改變了飲食。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B83","t":"可歸因於"},{"w":"collaborative","pos":"adj.","def":"involving people working together","cn":"合作的","s":"The project was highly ________, because doctors, coaches and teachers all met once a month.","zh":"這個計畫高度合作，因為醫生、教練和老師每個月都會開一次會。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B84","t":"合作"},{"w":"concurrent","pos":"adj.","def":"happening at the same time","cn":"同時發生的","s":"Two ________ studies reached the same conclusion, so the findings were taken seriously straight away.","zh":"兩項同時進行的研究得出相同結論，所以這些發現立刻受到重視。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B85","t":"同時進行的"},{"w":"consequential","pos":"adj.","def":"important because it leads to serious results","cn":"影響重大的","s":"The most ________ decision of the season was made in June, when the club replaced its head coach.","zh":"本季影響最重大的決定是在六月做出的，當時俱樂部換掉了總教練。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B86","t":"影響最重大的"},{"w":"illustrative","pos":"adj.","def":"useful as an example","cn":"具說明性的","s":"Her career is ________ of a wider change, because many athletes now study while they compete.","zh":"她的職涯說明了一種更廣泛的變化，因為許多運動員現在一邊比賽一邊讀書。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B87","t":"說明了"},{"w":"marked","pos":"adj.","def":"clear and easy to notice","cn":"明顯的","s":"There was a ________ difference after six weeks, and even the players themselves could feel the change.","zh":"六週後出現明顯的差異，而連球員自己都能感覺到這個變化。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B88","t":"明顯的"},{"w":"normative","pos":"adj.","def":"describing what is considered normal or correct","cn":"規範性的","s":"The chart gives ________ values for teenagers, so you can compare your own result with the usual range.","zh":"這張圖表提供青少年的規範性數值，所以你可以把自己的結果與一般範圍比較。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B89","t":"規範性"},{"w":"pending","pos":"adj.","def":"waiting to be decided or dealt with","cn":"待決的；未決的","s":"His appeal is still ________, so he may not play in any official match until the committee decides.","zh":"他的申訴仍未決，所以在委員會做出決定前他可能無法參加任何正式比賽。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B90","t":"未決"},{"w":"practicable","pos":"adj.","def":"able to be done successfully","cn":"行得通的","s":"Training twice a day is not ________ for students, because they also need time for homework and sleep.","zh":"一天訓練兩次對學生來說行不通，因為他們也需要時間做功課和睡覺。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B91","t":"行不通"},{"w":"predictive","pos":"adj.","def":"able to show what will probably happen","cn":"有預測力的","s":"The test has some ________ value, but no single number can tell you who will become a champion.","zh":"這項測驗有一定的預測價值，但沒有任何單一數字能告訴你誰會成為冠軍。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B92","t":"預測"},{"w":"proportionate","pos":"adj.","def":"matching something else in size or importance","cn":"相稱的；成比例的","s":"The punishment should be ________ to the offence, so a first small mistake rarely leads to a long ban.","zh":"處罰應該與違規行為相稱，所以初次的小錯誤很少導致長期禁賽。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B93","t":"相稱"},{"w":"relative","pos":"adj.","def":"considered in comparison with something else","cn":"相對的","s":"Her ________ strength is excellent, because she lifts twice her own body weight despite being quite small.","zh":"她的相對力量非常出色，因為儘管她身材相當小，卻能舉起自身體重的兩倍。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B94","t":"相對"},{"w":"requisite","pos":"adj.","def":"needed for a particular purpose","cn":"必要的","s":"He lacked the ________ experience for the national squad, so the selectors asked him to wait another year.","zh":"他缺乏進國家隊所必要的經驗，所以選拔委員請他再等一年。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B95","t":"必要的"},{"w":"respective","pos":"adj.","def":"belonging separately to each person mentioned","cn":"各自的","s":"The two runners returned to their ________ clubs after the camp, and they met again at the final.","zh":"訓練營結束後兩位跑者回到各自的俱樂部，而他們在決賽中再次相遇。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B96","t":"各自的"},{"w":"unilateral","pos":"adj.","def":"done by one side only","cn":"單方面的","s":"The club made a ________ decision to cancel the tour, and the players only heard about it on the news.","zh":"俱樂部單方面決定取消巡迴賽，而球員們只是從新聞上得知。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B97","t":"單方面"},{"w":"avoidable","pos":"adj.","def":"able to be prevented","cn":"可避免的","s":"Most of these ankle injuries are ________, because a proper warm-up takes only ten minutes of your time.","zh":"這些腳踝傷害大多是可避免的，因為適當的熱身只需要花你十分鐘。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B98","t":"可避免的"},{"w":"debilitating","pos":"adj.","def":"making someone very weak","cn":"使人虛弱的","s":"The illness was ________, so she could not train for three months, but she returned stronger in the spring.","zh":"那場病使她非常虛弱，所以她三個月無法訓練，但她在春天以更強的狀態回歸。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B99","t":"使她非常虛弱"},{"w":"equivocal","pos":"adj.","def":"unclear and open to more than one meaning","cn":"含糊的；模稜兩可的","s":"The results were ________, so the scientists refused to recommend the method until more work had been done.","zh":"結果模稜兩可，所以科學家在更多研究完成前拒絕推薦這個方法。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B100","t":"模稜兩可"},{"w":"favourable","pos":"adj.","def":"good for you or helpful","cn":"有利的","s":"The weather was ________ on race day, and six runners finished inside their personal best times.","zh":"比賽當天天氣有利，而六位跑者都跑進了自己的最佳成績。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B101","t":"有利"},{"w":"hazardous","pos":"adj.","def":"dangerous","cn":"危險的","s":"Running on that road is ________ after dark, so the club moved its evening sessions to the park.","zh":"天黑後在那條路上跑步很危險，所以社團把晚間訓練移到公園。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B102","t":"危險"},{"w":"impractical","pos":"adj.","def":"not sensible or possible in real life","cn":"不切實際的","s":"The plan was ________ for a small school, because it needed a full-time coach and a heated pool.","zh":"這個計畫對小型學校不切實際，因為它需要一位全職教練和一座溫水游泳池。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B103","t":"不切實際"},{"w":"insightful","pos":"adj.","def":"showing clear and deep understanding","cn":"有洞見的","s":"Her ________ comments after the match helped the young players, and nobody felt blamed for the defeat.","zh":"她賽後富有洞見的評論幫助了年輕球員，而沒有人因為落敗而感到被責怪。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B104","t":"富有洞見的"},{"w":"instructive","pos":"adj.","def":"giving useful information or lessons","cn":"有教育意義的","s":"The defeat was ________, because it showed the team exactly which skills they still had to practise.","zh":"這場敗仗很有教育意義，因為它確切顯示了球隊還必須練習哪些技能。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B105","t":"很有教育意義"},{"w":"multidisciplinary","pos":"adj.","def":"involving several different subjects or specialists","cn":"多專業的；跨領域的","s":"A ________ team now supports the squad, and it includes a doctor, a dietitian and a psychologist.","zh":"現在有一支跨領域團隊支援這支隊伍，其中包括醫生、營養師和心理師。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B106","t":"跨領域"},{"w":"obtainable","pos":"adj.","def":"able to be got or achieved","cn":"可獲得的","s":"The data is freely ________ online, so any coach can read the full report without paying.","zh":"這些數據在網路上可免費取得，所以任何教練都能不付費閱讀完整報告。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B107","t":"可免費取得"},{"w":"perceptive","pos":"adj.","def":"quick to notice and understand things","cn":"敏銳的","s":"A ________ coach spots tiredness before an athlete complains, and she changes the session straight away.","zh":"敏銳的教練會在運動員抱怨前就看出疲勞，而她會立刻調整訓練內容。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B108","t":"敏銳的"},{"w":"permissible","pos":"adj.","def":"allowed by the rules","cn":"允許的","s":"Only one type of shoe is ________ in this event, and officials check every athlete before the start.","zh":"這個項目只允許一種鞋款，而官員在起跑前會檢查每位選手。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B109","t":"允許"},{"w":"preventable","pos":"adj.","def":"able to be stopped before it happens","cn":"可預防的","s":"Heat illness is largely ________, so coaches must provide shade and water during summer training.","zh":"熱傷害大致上可預防，所以教練必須在夏季訓練時提供遮蔭和飲水。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B110","t":"可預防"},{"w":"reasoned","pos":"adj.","def":"based on careful thinking","cn":"有理有據的","s":"She gave a ________ argument for resting the captain, and the other coaches quickly agreed with her.","zh":"她提出了讓隊長休息的有理有據的論點，而其他教練很快就同意了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B111","t":"有理有據的"},{"w":"recurring","pos":"adj.","def":"happening again and again","cn":"反覆出現的","s":"His ________ shoulder problem finally improved after he changed his swimming technique, and now he trains without pain.","zh":"他反覆出現的肩膀問題在他改變游泳技術後終於好轉，而現在他訓練時不再疼痛。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B112","t":"反覆出現的"},{"w":"reliant","pos":"adj.","def":"depending on someone or something","cn":"依賴的","s":"The team became too ________ on one striker, so when he was injured they struggled to score.","zh":"球隊變得太依賴一位前鋒，所以當他受傷時他們很難得分。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B113","t":"依賴"},{"w":"repeatable","pos":"adj.","def":"able to be done again in the same way","cn":"可重複的","s":"A good test must be ________, so the same athlete should get a similar score on a different day.","zh":"好的測驗必須可重複，所以同一位運動員在不同日子應該得到相似的分數。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B114","t":"可重複"},{"w":"replicable","pos":"adj.","def":"able to be copied exactly by other researchers","cn":"可複製的","s":"The method is simple and ________, and three other universities have since repeated the experiment.","zh":"這個方法簡單且可複製，而後來有三所其他大學重複了這項實驗。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B115","t":"可複製"},{"w":"transferable","pos":"adj.","def":"able to be used in a different situation","cn":"可轉移的","s":"Teamwork is a ________ skill, so what you learn on the court also helps you in group projects at school.","zh":"團隊合作是一種可轉移的技能，所以你在球場上學到的也能幫助你在學校做小組作業。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B116","t":"可轉移的"},{"w":"unavoidable","pos":"adj.","def":"impossible to prevent","cn":"無法避免的","s":"Some physical contact is ________ in a fast basketball game, but dangerous play is punished immediately by the officials.","zh":"在快節奏的籃球比賽中某些身體接觸是無法避免的，但危險的動作會被裁判立刻處罰。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B117","t":"無法避免的"},{"w":"uncontrolled","pos":"adj.","def":"not managed or limited","cn":"未受控制的","s":"________ use of supplements worries doctors, because teenagers sometimes take far more than the label suggests.","zh":"補充品的未受管控使用令醫生擔憂，因為青少年有時服用的量遠超過標籤建議。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B118","t":"未受管控"},{"w":"underrated","pos":"adj.","def":"not valued as highly as it should be","cn":"被低估的","s":"Rest is the most ________ part of training, and many young athletes still think more is always better.","zh":"休息是訓練中最被低估的部分，而許多年輕運動員仍認為越多越好。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B119","t":"被低估的"},{"w":"undesirable","pos":"adj.","def":"not wanted because it causes problems","cn":"不良的；不受歡迎的","s":"Rapid weight loss has several ________ effects, so the dietitian planned a slower and safer programme.","zh":"快速減重有幾種不良影響，所以營養師規劃了一個較慢且較安全的計畫。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B120","t":"不良"},{"w":"unfavourable","pos":"adj.","def":"not helpful or good for you","cn":"不利的","s":"Conditions were ________ for a record, because a strong wind blew straight into the runners' faces.","zh":"當時的條件對破紀錄不利，因為強風正面吹向跑者的臉。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B121","t":"不利"},{"w":"unproven","pos":"adj.","def":"not yet shown to be true or effective","cn":"未經證實的","s":"The treatment is still ________, so the club will not pay for it until better evidence appears.","zh":"這種療法仍未經證實，所以在更好的證據出現前俱樂部不會支付費用。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B122","t":"未經證實"},{"w":"age-appropriate","pos":"adj.","def":"suitable for a person's age","cn":"適齡的","s":"Children need ________ training in every sport, because exercises designed for adults can easily damage their growing joints.","zh":"兒童在每種運動中都需要適齡的訓練，因為為成人設計的運動很容易傷害他們發育中的關節。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B123","t":"適齡的"},{"w":"self-reported","pos":"adj.","def":"based on what people say about themselves","cn":"自我回報的","s":"The study used ________ sleep times, so the numbers may be a little too generous.","zh":"這項研究使用自我回報的睡眠時間，所以這些數字可能稍微偏寬鬆。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B124","t":"自我回報的"},{"w":"large-scale","pos":"adj.","def":"involving many people or a wide area","cn":"大規模的","s":"A ________ survey of ten thousand students found that only a third exercised every day.","zh":"一項對一萬名學生的大規模調查發現只有三分之一的人每天運動。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B125","t":"大規模"},{"w":"small-scale","pos":"adj.","def":"limited in size or number","cn":"小規模的","s":"The first trial was ________, but it gave the researchers enough confidence to apply for more funding.","zh":"第一次試驗規模很小，但它給了研究人員足夠的信心去申請更多經費。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B126","t":"很小"},{"w":"long-term","pos":"adj.","def":"continuing for a long period","cn":"長期的","s":"The ________ benefits of exercise are enormous, although many people only notice the short-term tiredness.","zh":"運動的長期益處非常巨大，雖然許多人只注意到短期的疲累。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B127","t":"長期"},{"w":"short-term","pos":"adj.","def":"lasting only a short period","cn":"短期的","s":"A ________ gain in speed is useless if the training leaves you injured for the whole season.","zh":"如果訓練讓你整季受傷，速度上的短期提升就毫無用處。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B128","t":"短期"},{"w":"wide-ranging","pos":"adj.","def":"covering many different subjects","cn":"範圍廣泛的","s":"The report was ________, and it discussed everything from school timetables to the design of playgrounds.","zh":"這份報告範圍廣泛，從學校課表到遊戲場設計無所不談。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B129","t":"範圍廣泛"},{"w":"cross-sectional","pos":"adj.","def":"looking at many people at one point in time","cn":"橫斷面的","s":"A ________ study can show a pattern quickly, but it cannot prove that one thing caused another.","zh":"橫斷面研究能快速顯示一種模式，但它無法證明一件事導致了另一件事。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B130","t":"橫斷面"},{"w":"adversely","pos":"adv.","def":"in a way that causes harm","cn":"不利地；有害地","s":"Poor sleep ________ affects reaction time, so coaches now ask players to switch off their phones before midnight.","zh":"睡眠不足會不利地影響反應時間，所以教練現在要求球員在午夜前關掉手機。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B131","t":"不利地"},{"w":"appreciably","pos":"adv.","def":"by an amount large enough to notice","cn":"明顯地","s":"Her times improved ________ after she changed her diet, although she had not changed her training at all.","zh":"她改變飲食後成績明顯進步，雖然她完全沒有改變訓練方式。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B132","t":"明顯"},{"w":"categorically","pos":"adv.","def":"in a clear and complete way, with no doubt","cn":"斷然地；明確地","s":"The athlete ________ denied taking any banned drug, and later tests supported what she had said.","zh":"那位運動員斷然否認服用任何禁藥，而後來的檢測支持了她的說法。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B133","t":"斷然"},{"w":"comprehensively","pos":"adv.","def":"completely and in every way","cn":"全面地；徹底地","s":"Our team was beaten ________ in the first round, but we learned a great deal from the experience.","zh":"我們球隊在第一輪被徹底擊敗，但我們從這次經驗中學到很多。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B134","t":"徹底"},{"w":"decisively","pos":"adv.","def":"in a firm way that settles something","cn":"果斷地；決定性地","s":"She acted ________ at the final bend, and she had opened a clear gap before the others reacted.","zh":"她在最後一個彎道果斷地發動，而在其他人反應前她已拉開明顯差距。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B135","t":"果斷地"},{"w":"demonstrably","pos":"adv.","def":"in a way that can be proved","cn":"可證明地；明顯地","s":"Warming up is ________ safer than starting cold, and dozens of studies have reached the same conclusion.","zh":"熱身明顯地比直接開始更安全，而數十項研究得出相同結論。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B136","t":"明顯地"},{"w":"erroneously","pos":"adv.","def":"wrongly or by mistake","cn":"錯誤地","s":"The report ________ stated that he had failed a test, so the newspaper printed an apology the next day.","zh":"那份報告錯誤地說他檢測未通過，所以報社隔天刊登了道歉。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B137","t":"錯誤地"},{"w":"implicitly","pos":"adv.","def":"in a way that is suggested but not said directly","cn":"含蓄地；隱含地","s":"By choosing him as captain, the coach ________ accepted his ideas about training, and the older players noticed.","zh":"教練選他當隊長，就隱含地接受了他對訓練的想法，而資深球員都注意到了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B138","t":"隱含地"},{"w":"inadvertently","pos":"adv.","def":"without meaning to","cn":"不經意地；無意中","s":"He ________ took a banned substance in a cold remedy, but the panel accepted that it was an honest mistake.","zh":"他在感冒藥中無意間服用了禁用物質，但委員會接受那是個無心之過。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B139","t":"無意間"},{"w":"incrementally","pos":"adv.","def":"in a series of small steps","cn":"逐步地","s":"Add weight ________ each week, because sudden jumps are the quickest way to hurt yourself.","zh":"每週逐步增加重量，因為突然加重是最快讓自己受傷的方式。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B140","t":"逐步"},{"w":"indisputably","pos":"adv.","def":"in a way nobody can argue against","cn":"無可爭辯地","s":"She is ________ the best player of her generation, although she has never won a world title.","zh":"她無可爭辯地是她那一代最好的球員，儘管她從未贏得世界冠軍。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B141","t":"無可爭辯地"},{"w":"meticulously","pos":"adv.","def":"with great care and attention to detail","cn":"一絲不苟地","s":"He records every session ________, so he can see exactly what worked before his best races.","zh":"他一絲不苟地記錄每次訓練，所以他能確切看出在最佳表現前哪些做法有效。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B142","t":"一絲不苟地"},{"w":"objectively","pos":"adv.","def":"without being influenced by feelings","cn":"客觀地","s":"Video lets coaches judge performance ________, because the camera does not care who the player is.","zh":"影片讓教練能客觀地評斷表現，因為攝影機不在意球員是誰。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B143","t":"客觀地"},{"w":"proportionally","pos":"adv.","def":"in a way that matches something else in size","cn":"成比例地","s":"Children's equipment should be ________ smaller, so a junior ball is lighter than an adult one.","zh":"兒童的器材應該成比例地較小，所以兒童用球比成人用球輕。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B144","t":"成比例地"},{"w":"rigorously","pos":"adv.","def":"in a strict and thorough way","cn":"嚴格地","s":"Every supplement is tested ________ before the team uses it, because one mistake could end a career.","zh":"每種補充品在球隊使用前都經過嚴格檢測，因為一個錯誤可能結束一段職業生涯。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B145","t":"嚴格"},{"w":"significantly","pos":"adv.","def":"by an important amount","cn":"顯著地","s":"Injury numbers fell ________ after the new warm-up was introduced, and other schools soon copied it.","zh":"在引入新的熱身方式後，受傷人數顯著下降，而其他學校很快就效法。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B146","t":"顯著"},{"w":"systematically","pos":"adv.","def":"in an organised, step-by-step way","cn":"系統地","s":"The coach ________ worked through each weakness, and by March the team had almost no defensive errors.","zh":"教練系統地處理每一個弱點，而到了三月球隊幾乎沒有防守失誤。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B147","t":"系統地"},{"w":"tentatively","pos":"adv.","def":"in a careful, uncertain way","cn":"試探性地；暫時地","s":"The doctors ________ cleared him to train, but they asked him to stop if any pain returned.","zh":"醫生暫時許可他訓練，但他們要求他若有任何疼痛復發就停止。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B148","t":"暫時"},{"w":"thoroughly","pos":"adv.","def":"completely and carefully","cn":"徹底地","s":"Clean the equipment ________ after every single session, because shared mats can easily spread skin infections among players.","zh":"每一次訓練後都要徹底清潔器材，因為共用的墊子很容易在球員之間傳播皮膚感染。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B149","t":"徹底"},{"w":"universally","pos":"adv.","def":"by everyone or everywhere","cn":"普遍地；全體一致地","s":"The new rule was ________ welcomed, and even the oldest coaches admitted that it made the game safer.","zh":"新規則受到普遍歡迎，而連最資深的教練都承認它讓比賽更安全。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B150","t":"普遍"},{"w":"adduce","pos":"v.","def":"to give evidence or reasons for something","cn":"舉出（證據）","s":"The lawyer could ________ no evidence of cheating, so the committee cleared the swimmer completely.","zh":"律師無法舉出任何作弊的證據，所以委員會徹底還了那位泳者清白。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B151","t":"舉出"},{"w":"avail","pos":"v.","def":"to make use of something that is offered","cn":"利用","s":"Students should ________ themselves of the free gym classes, because the teachers are qualified and the sessions are safe.","zh":"學生應該利用免費的健身課程，因為老師都有資格，而課程也很安全。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B152","t":"利用"},{"w":"bemoan","pos":"v.","def":"to complain about something","cn":"抱怨；哀嘆","s":"Fans often ________ the cost of tickets, but they still fill the ground for every important match.","zh":"球迷常抱怨票價，但每場重要比賽他們仍把球場填滿。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B153","t":"抱怨"},{"w":"broach","pos":"v.","def":"to begin talking about a difficult subject","cn":"開始談論（難題）","s":"Nobody wanted to ________ the subject of retirement, so the captain finally raised it himself.","zh":"沒有人想開口談退休這件事，所以隊長最後自己提了出來。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B154","t":"開口談"},{"w":"canvass","pos":"v.","def":"to ask many people for their opinions","cn":"徵詢意見","s":"The club will ________ members before changing the shirt, because the old design has been used for fifty years.","zh":"俱樂部在更改球衣前會徵詢會員意見，因為舊設計已使用了五十年。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B155","t":"徵詢"},{"w":"castigate","pos":"v.","def":"to criticise someone severely","cn":"嚴厲批評","s":"The press ________ the manager after the defeat, but the players defended him in every interview.","zh":"媒體在落敗後嚴厲批評總教練，但球員在每次訪問中都為他辯護。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B156","t":"嚴厲批評"},{"w":"decelerate","pos":"v.","def":"to slow down","cn":"減速","s":"Learning to ________ safely matters as much as sprinting, because most knee injuries happen when players stop suddenly.","zh":"學會安全減速和衝刺一樣重要，因為大多數膝傷發生在球員突然停下時。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B157","t":"減速"},{"w":"desist","pos":"v.","def":"to stop doing something","cn":"停止","s":"The referee warned both captains to ________ from arguing, or he would show a card to each of them.","zh":"裁判警告兩位隊長停止爭論，否則他會對他們各出一張牌。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B158","t":"停止"},{"w":"disband","pos":"v.","def":"to break up a group or team","cn":"解散","s":"The club had to ________ its junior section, because only four children turned up for training.","zh":"俱樂部必須解散青少年組，因為只有四個孩子出席訓練。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B159","t":"解散"},{"w":"disentangle","pos":"v.","def":"to separate things that are mixed together","cn":"釐清；解開","s":"Researchers tried to ________ the effects of diet and sleep, but the two were closely connected.","zh":"研究人員試圖釐清飲食和睡眠的影響，但兩者緊密相關。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B160","t":"釐清"},{"w":"formalise","pos":"v.","def":"to make something official","cn":"使正式化","s":"The school decided to ________ its safety rules, so every coach signed a written agreement.","zh":"學校決定正式確立其安全規定，所以每位教練都簽了書面同意書。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B161","t":"正式確立"},{"w":"incapacitate","pos":"v.","def":"to make someone unable to do things","cn":"使失去能力","s":"A single bad tackle can ________ a player for months, so dangerous challenges carry heavy punishments.","zh":"一次糟糕的擒抱就可能讓球員失去行動能力好幾個月，所以危險的動作會受到重罰。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B162","t":"失去行動能力"},{"w":"incentivise","pos":"v.","def":"to encourage people by offering a reward","cn":"以誘因激勵","s":"The city tried to ________ walking by giving free bus tickets to people who recorded ten thousand steps.","zh":"市政府試圖以誘因鼓勵步行，為記錄到一萬步的人提供免費公車票。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B163","t":"以誘因鼓勵"},{"w":"normalise","pos":"v.","def":"to make something become usual or accepted","cn":"使正常化","s":"Clubs are working to ________ talking about mental health, so players no longer hide their worries.","zh":"俱樂部正努力讓談論心理健康變得稀鬆平常，所以球員不再隱藏自己的煩惱。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B164","t":"變得稀鬆平常"},{"w":"penalise","pos":"v.","def":"to punish someone for breaking a rule","cn":"處罰","s":"Referees now ________ any contact with the head, and the number of serious injuries has fallen.","zh":"裁判現在會處罰任何碰觸頭部的動作，而重傷的數量已經下降。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B165","t":"處罰"},{"w":"tabulate","pos":"v.","def":"to arrange information in a table","cn":"製成表格","s":"She asked us to ________ our weekly distances, so the pattern of our training became easy to see.","zh":"她要我們把每週的距離製成表格，這樣我們訓練的模式就變得容易看出。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B166","t":"製成表格"},{"w":"equalise","pos":"v.","def":"to score so that both sides have the same points","cn":"追成平手","s":"We managed to ________ in the last minute, and the crowd behind the goal went completely wild.","zh":"我們在最後一分鐘成功追成平手，而球門後方的觀眾完全瘋了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B167","t":"追成平手"},{"w":"repeal","pos":"v.","def":"to officially end a law or rule","cn":"廢除","s":"The federation voted to ________ the old rule, because modern equipment had made it pointless.","zh":"聯盟投票廢除舊規則，因為現代裝備已讓它失去意義。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B168","t":"廢除"},{"w":"vanquish","pos":"v.","def":"to defeat someone completely","cn":"徹底擊敗","s":"They expected to ________ the visitors easily, but the match ended in a surprising draw.","zh":"他們預期能輕鬆擊敗客隊，但比賽卻以令人意外的平手收場。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B169","t":"擊敗"},{"w":"realign","pos":"v.","def":"to change the position or arrangement of something","cn":"重新調整","s":"The physiotherapist helped him ________ his running style, and the pain in his hip slowly disappeared.","zh":"物理治療師幫助他重新調整跑姿，而他髖部的疼痛慢慢消失了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B170","t":"重新調整"},{"w":"contextualise","pos":"v.","def":"to explain something by describing its situation","cn":"置於脈絡中解釋","s":"Good teachers ________ each statistic, so students understand what a number actually means in real life.","zh":"好老師會把每個統計數字放進脈絡中解釋，讓學生理解一個數字在現實中真正的意義。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B171","t":"放進脈絡中解釋"},{"w":"cross-reference","pos":"v.","def":"to compare information from two different sources","cn":"交叉比對","s":"The scientists ________ the training diaries with the injury records, and a clear pattern soon appeared.","zh":"科學家把訓練日誌與受傷紀錄交叉比對，而一個清楚的模式很快浮現。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B172","t":"交叉比對"},{"w":"destabilise","pos":"v.","def":"to make something less steady or secure","cn":"使不穩定","s":"Weak hip muscles can ________ the knee, so strengthening them often reduces pain for runners.","zh":"髖部肌肉無力會使膝蓋不穩定，所以強化它們常常能減輕跑者的疼痛。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B173","t":"使 不穩定"},{"w":"downsize","pos":"v.","def":"to make an organisation smaller","cn":"縮編；精簡","s":"The club had to ________ after losing its main sponsor, so two coaching posts disappeared at the end of June.","zh":"失去主要贊助商後俱樂部必須縮編，所以兩個教練職位在六月底消失了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B174","t":"縮編"},{"w":"institutionalise","pos":"v.","def":"to make a practice part of an organisation's system","cn":"制度化","s":"They want to ________ rest days, so every athlete gets one full day off written into the plan.","zh":"他們希望把休息日制度化，讓每位運動員的計畫中都寫入完整的一天休假。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B175","t":"制度化"},{"w":"interrelate","pos":"v.","def":"to be connected with and affect each other","cn":"相互關聯","s":"Sleep, diet and mood all ________, so changing one of them usually changes the other two as well.","zh":"睡眠、飲食和情緒全都相互關聯，所以改變其中之一通常也會改變另外兩項。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B176","t":"相互關聯"},{"w":"itemise","pos":"v.","def":"to list things separately","cn":"逐項列出","s":"Please ________ every piece of equipment you need, and the school will tell you what the budget can cover.","zh":"請逐項列出你需要的每一件器材，而學校會告訴你預算能支付哪些。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B177","t":"逐項列出"},{"w":"misjudge","pos":"v.","def":"to form a wrong opinion about something","cn":"誤判","s":"The goalkeeper ________ the flight of the ball, so it bounced over his hands and into the net.","zh":"守門員誤判了球的飛行路線，所以球彈過他的手飛進球網。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B178","t":"誤判"},{"w":"rank","pos":"v.","def":"to put things in order of quality or importance","cn":"排名","s":"The magazine tried to ________ the world's hardest races, but readers argued about the order for weeks.","zh":"那本雜誌試圖為世界上最艱難的比賽排名，但讀者為排序爭論了好幾週。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B179","t":"排名"},{"w":"rationalise","pos":"v.","def":"to make something simpler and more efficient","cn":"使合理化；精簡","s":"The federation plans to ________ the competition calendar, because players currently travel almost every weekend.","zh":"聯盟計畫精簡賽程表，因為球員目前幾乎每個週末都在奔波。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B180","t":"精簡"},{"w":"recalibrate","pos":"v.","def":"to adjust a measuring device or a plan","cn":"重新校準","s":"The staff must ________ the timing gates each morning, or the recorded speeds will be slightly wrong.","zh":"工作人員每天早上必須重新校準計時門，否則記錄的速度會稍有偏差。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B181","t":"重新校準"},{"w":"reclassify","pos":"v.","def":"to put something into a different group","cn":"重新分類","s":"Officials decided to ________ the event as high-risk, so medical staff must now be present throughout.","zh":"官員決定把這項賽事重新分類為高風險，所以現在醫護人員必須全程在場。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B182","t":"重新分類"},{"w":"reconfigure","pos":"v.","def":"to arrange something in a different way","cn":"重新配置","s":"The gym was ________ over the summer, and the free-weight area is now twice as large.","zh":"健身房在暑假期間重新配置，而自由重量區現在大了兩倍。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B183","t":"重新配置"},{"w":"redesign","pos":"v.","def":"to plan or make something again in a new way","cn":"重新設計","s":"Engineers had to ________ the helmet, because tests showed that it moved too easily on impact.","zh":"工程師必須重新設計那款頭盔，因為測試顯示它在撞擊時太容易移位。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B184","t":"重新設計"},{"w":"reformulate","pos":"v.","def":"to express or make something in a new form","cn":"重新擬定；重新調配","s":"The company had to ________ the drink after one ingredient was banned, and the new version tastes less sweet.","zh":"在一種成分被禁用後，公司必須重新調配這款飲料，而新版本嘗起來比較不甜。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B185","t":"重新調配"},{"w":"synchronise","pos":"v.","def":"to make things happen at exactly the same time","cn":"使同步","s":"The pair must ________ every movement, because even a tiny difference loses marks in this event.","zh":"這組選手必須讓每個動作同步，因為在這個項目中即使微小的差異也會失分。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B186","t":"同步"},{"w":"forewarn","pos":"v.","def":"to tell someone about a problem before it happens","cn":"預先警告","s":"The doctor ________ her that recovery would be slow, so she was not shocked when progress took months.","zh":"醫生事先警告她復原會很慢，所以當進展花了好幾個月時她並不驚訝。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B187","t":"事先警告"},{"w":"overcompensate","pos":"v.","def":"to do too much to make up for a problem","cn":"過度補償","s":"Injured runners often ________ with the other leg, and that is why a second injury appears so often.","zh":"受傷的跑者常用另一條腿過度補償，而這就是第二次受傷如此常見的原因。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B188","t":"過度補償"},{"w":"pre-empt","pos":"v.","def":"to act first in order to prevent something","cn":"先行阻止；搶先","s":"Good coaches ________ arguments by explaining their selections to the whole squad before the team sheet goes up.","zh":"好教練會在名單公布前向全隊解釋選人理由，以搶先避免爭吵。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B189","t":"搶先避免"},{"w":"rebalance","pos":"v.","def":"to change the proportions of something","cn":"重新平衡","s":"He had to ________ his week, so he now trains four days and studies on the other three.","zh":"他必須重新平衡自己的一週，所以他現在訓練四天，另外三天讀書。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B190","t":"重新平衡"},{"w":"redouble","pos":"v.","def":"to greatly increase your effort","cn":"加倍（努力）","s":"After the narrow defeat the squad ________ its efforts, and the players arrived early every morning.","zh":"在那場惜敗後，隊伍加倍努力，而球員每天早上都提早到場。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B191","t":"加倍"},{"w":"reorient","pos":"v.","def":"to change the direction or focus of something","cn":"重新定位","s":"The club wants to ________ its programme towards enjoyment, because too many teenagers were giving up.","zh":"俱樂部想把課程重新定位於樂趣，因為太多青少年中途放棄。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B192","t":"重新定位"},{"w":"shortlist","pos":"v.","def":"to choose a small group from many applicants","cn":"列入最終名單","s":"The selectors will ________ twenty players next week, and the final squad will be named in May.","zh":"選拔委員下週會挑出二十位球員進入最終名單，而正式名單將在五月公布。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B193","t":"挑出"},{"w":"vet","pos":"v.","def":"to check someone or something carefully before accepting them","cn":"審查","s":"The club must ________ every volunteer coach, because anyone working with children needs a background check.","zh":"俱樂部必須審查每位志工教練，因為任何與兒童共事的人都需要背景調查。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B194","t":"審查"},{"w":"scale up","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to make something bigger or available to more people","cn":"擴大規模","s":"The city wants to ______ ______ the free swimming scheme, so every primary school will join by next year.","zh":"市政府希望擴大免費游泳計畫的規模，所以明年前每所小學都會加入。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B195","t":"擴大"},{"w":"roll out","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to introduce a new plan or product widely","cn":"推出；全面實施","s":"The league will ______ ______ the new concussion test in August, and all referees are being trained now.","zh":"聯盟將在八月全面推行新的腦部撞擊檢測，而所有裁判現在都在接受訓練。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B196","t":"全面推行"},{"w":"fine-tune","pos":"v.","def":"to make small changes that improve something","cn":"微調","s":"She spent the winter trying to ________ her start, and she gained a tenth of a second by spring.","zh":"她整個冬天都在試著微調起跑，而到春天她進步了十分之一秒。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B197","t":"微調"},{"w":"triangulate","pos":"v.","def":"to check a finding by using three different sources","cn":"三角驗證","s":"The researchers ________ their results with interviews, video and lab tests, so their conclusions were hard to argue with.","zh":"研究人員用訪談、影片和實驗室檢測三角驗證結果，所以他們的結論難以反駁。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B198","t":"三角驗證"},{"w":"deselect","pos":"v.","def":"to leave a player out of a team","cn":"不予選入；剔除","s":"The coach had to ________ two popular players, and she explained her reasons to them in private first.","zh":"教練必須不選入兩位受歡迎的球員，而她先私下向他們解釋了理由。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B199","t":"不選入"},{"w":"log","pos":"v.","def":"to write down a record of something regularly","cn":"記錄","s":"Athletes ________ their training in an app, so the coach can spot problems before an injury happens.","zh":"運動員用應用程式記錄訓練，所以教練能在受傷發生前發現問題。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B200","t":"記錄"},{"w":"raise the bar","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to set a higher standard than before","cn":"提高標準","s":"Her world record really ______ ______ ______ for everyone, and three other runners went faster within a year.","zh":"她的世界紀錄確實為所有人提高了標準，而一年內另外三位跑者都跑得更快了。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P1","t":"提高了標準"},{"w":"move the goalposts","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to unfairly change the rules or aims during something","cn":"中途改變規則","s":"The committee kept changing the entry standard, and the athletes complained that it was trying to ______ ______ ______.","zh":"委員會不斷改變參賽標準，而運動員抱怨它是在中途改變規則。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P2","t":"中途改變規則"},{"w":"keep one's eye on the ball","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to stay focused on what matters","cn":"專注於重點","s":"There are many distractions before a big final, so the captain told everyone to ______ ______ ______ ______ ______ ______.","zh":"大賽前有許多令人分心的事，所以隊長叫大家專注於重點。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P3","t":"專注於重點"},{"w":"out of one's league","pos":"adj.phr.","def":"at a much higher level than you can match","cn":"遠超出能力範圍","s":"We were clearly ______ ______ ______ ______ in the first half, but we defended bravely and only lost by two goals.","zh":"上半場我們明顯實力不如對手，但我們勇敢防守，只輸了兩球。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P4","t":"實力不如對手"},{"w":"ahead of the game","pos":"adj.phr.","def":"in a better position than your rivals","cn":"領先同業；佔先機","s":"The club bought its own data system early, so it stayed ______ ______ ______ ______ for several seasons.","zh":"這家俱樂部很早就購入自己的數據系統，所以它好幾個球季都保持領先。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P5","t":"保持領先"},{"w":"neck and neck","pos":"adj.phr.","def":"exactly equal in a race or competition","cn":"不分軒輊","s":"The two swimmers were ______ ______ ______ with ten metres to go, and the crowd rose to its feet.","zh":"剩下十公尺時兩位泳者不分軒輊，而觀眾全體站了起來。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P6","t":"不分軒輊"},{"w":"down to the wire","pos":"adj.phr.","def":"not decided until the very last moment","cn":"直到最後一刻","s":"The title race went ______ ______ ______ ______, because both teams won every match until the final weekend.","zh":"冠軍之爭撐到最後一刻，因為兩隊直到最後一個週末前都贏下每場比賽。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P7","t":"撐到最後一刻"},{"w":"throw in the towel","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to give up","cn":"認輸；放棄","s":"He was two sets behind and exhausted, but he refused to ______ ______ ______ ______ and somehow won the match.","zh":"他落後兩盤又疲憊不堪，但他拒絕認輸，最後竟然贏下了那場比賽。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P8","t":"認輸"},{"w":"jump the gun","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to start too early","cn":"搶跑；過早行動","s":"One sprinter ______ ______ ______ in the final, so the officials called the runners back and gave him a warning.","zh":"決賽中一位短跑選手搶跑，所以官員把跑者叫回並給了他一次警告。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P9","t":"搶跑"},{"w":"par for the course","pos":"adj.phr.","def":"normal and to be expected in that situation","cn":"稀鬆平常；在所難免","s":"Sore legs after a long run are ______ ______ ______ ______, so do not worry unless the pain is sharp.","zh":"長跑後雙腿痠痛是在所難免的，所以除非是劇痛，否則不用擔心。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P10","t":"在所難免的"},{"w":"hit one's stride","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to begin doing something confidently and well","cn":"進入狀況；找到節奏","s":"She started the season slowly, but she ______ ______ ______ in March and scored in five matches.","zh":"她本季開季緩慢，但她在三月進入狀況，並在五場比賽中得分。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P11","t":"進入狀況"},{"w":"get a second wind","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to find new energy after feeling tired","cn":"重振精神；恢復體力","s":"I thought I would have to walk, but I ______ ______ ______ ______ at the top of the hill and ran the rest.","zh":"我以為我得改成走路，但我在山頂恢復了體力，並跑完了剩下的路程。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P12","t":"恢復了體力"},{"w":"go the distance","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to continue until something is finished","cn":"堅持到最後","s":"Many runners start too fast, so only those who pace themselves can really ______ ______ ______.","zh":"許多跑者一開始衝太快，所以只有懂得配速的人才能真正堅持到最後。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P13","t":"堅持到最後"},{"w":"in the running","pos":"adj.phr.","def":"still having a chance of winning","cn":"仍有機會","s":"After Saturday's win we are still ______ ______ ______ for the title, although we must beat the leaders next month.","zh":"星期六贏球後我們冠軍仍有機會，雖然我們下個月必須擊敗領先者。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P14","t":"仍有機會"},{"w":"bounce back","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to recover quickly after a defeat or problem","cn":"迅速復原；重新振作","s":"The young team lost badly in the opening game, but they ______ ______ and won their next four matches.","zh":"這支年輕球隊在開幕戰大敗，但他們重新振作並贏了接下來四場比賽。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P15","t":"重新振作"},{"w":"no pain, no gain","pos":"phr.","def":"you must work hard and suffer to improve","cn":"一分耕耘，一分收穫","s":"My coach always says \"______ ______, ______ ______\", but she also reminds us that sharp pain is a warning.","zh":"我的教練總是說「沒有付出就沒有收穫」，但她也提醒我們劇痛是一種警訊。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P16","t":"沒有付出就沒有收穫"},{"w":"win hands down","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to win very easily","cn":"輕鬆取勝","s":"They expected a close game, but the visitors ______ ______ ______ and led by thirty points at half-time.","zh":"他們預期會是一場勢均力敵的比賽，但客隊輕鬆取勝，中場休息時已領先三十分。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P17","t":"輕鬆取勝"},{"w":"by a whisker","pos":"adv.phr.","def":"by a very small amount","cn":"以極小的差距","s":"She missed the record ______ ______ ______, and she joked that she should have cut her hair that morning.","zh":"她以極小的差距錯失紀錄，而她開玩笑說那天早上應該去剪個頭髮。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P18","t":"以極小的差距"},{"w":"the home stretch","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the last part of a race or task","cn":"最後階段","s":"We are on ______ ______ ______ of the season now, so the coach wants everyone to stay healthy for three more weeks.","zh":"我們現在正處於本季的最後階段，所以教練希望大家再多保持三週的健康。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P19","t":"最後階段"},{"w":"give it one's all","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to try as hard as you possibly can","cn":"全力以赴","s":"He did not win a medal, but he ______ ______ ______ ______ and his family were proud of him anyway.","zh":"他沒有拿到獎牌，但他全力以赴，而他的家人無論如何都為他感到驕傲。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P20","t":"全力以赴"}]};
